 gender. This year, we will not be utilizing University of Utah and all campers and staff will be housed at Westminster University. Athletic facilities and coaches are subject to change. The camp is not owned, sponsored, controlled or endorsed by Westminster University.',10,17,'all','2026-06-01','2026-06-04',529.0,'per_session','$529','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/baseball-camp-westminster-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','inactive',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','53bb59f7-070b-46f0-989d-17693b2144b2','nike-baseball-camp-in-salt-lake-city-june-1-4-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
