paced drills, technical development, smallΓÇæsided games, and gameplayΓÇæfocused learning that challenges athletes to sharpen technique, expand their soccer IQ, and play with creativity and purpose. Each session is carefully designed to keep campers active, engaged, and motivated from start to finish. With topΓÇætier coaching from JM Soccer Academy and the proven structure and excitement of Nike Soccer Camps, this program delivers one of the most complete and inspiring soccer experiences in the Henderson/Las Vegas area. Join us this summer and take your game to the next level with elite coaching and nonstop fun!',4,14,'all','2026-06-01','2026-06-05',150.0,'per_session','$150','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-jm-soccer-academy-henderson-nv#session-80555-1215100',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','inactive',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','e5153271-8abb-427f-9af1-a8af5a4af791','nike-soccer-camp-with-jm-soccer-academy-in-henderson-june-1-5-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
