development, players will build confidence, improve their soccer fundamentals, learn teamwork and sportsmanship, and develop a lasting love for the game in a safe and encouraging environment."',6,14,'all','2026-06-08','2026-06-12',335.0,'per_session','$335','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-st-charles-il#session-82308-1217504',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','inactive',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','fe0eca01-306a-494e-af88-ed2e7b319112','nike-soccer-camp-in-st-charles-june-8-12-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
