oach Kyle Jones: ΓÇ£We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.ΓÇ¥',6,16,'all','2026-06-08','2026-06-12',455.0,'per_session','$455','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-grayslake#session-83254-1218797',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','inactive',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','fa7dd3ab-95ac-48bf-a6f0-752c0ce126a7','nike-soccer-camp-in-grayslake-june-8-12-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
