s perfect for young players of all levels who want to stay active, have fun, and improve their soccer skills over the summer. Whether new to the game or already playing, campers will enjoy a supportive environment focused on learning, playing, and enjoying the game with others."',6,14,'all','2026-06-08','2026-06-12',355.0,'per_session','$355','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/girls-soccer-camp-robert-morris-university#session-83091-1218554',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','inactive',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','d2872d32-f9d0-49de-91e6-dd80ab618431','robert-morris-university-girls-soccer-camp-june-8-12-2026-e1lg','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
