e next level! Hear from Coach Kyle Jones: ΓÇ£We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.ΓÇ¥',6,16,'all','2026-06-08','2026-06-12',475.0,'per_session','$475','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-schaumburg-il',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','inactive',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','cdd16bef-770c-4e0a-8971-a3dfc0cff621','nike-soccer-camp-in-schaumburg-day-camp-june-8-12-2026-5hxb','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
