kill development, players will build confidence, improve their soccer fundamentals, learn teamwork and sportsmanship, and develop a lasting love for the game in a safe and encouraging environment."',6,14,'all','2026-06-08','2026-06-12',335.0,'per_session','$335','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-st-charles-il',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','inactive',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','a5489402-04f3-45ff-be7f-abcd7f108057','nike-soccer-camp-in-st-charles-june-8-12-2026-ajb0','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
