o teach technique and game concepts so the kids build confidence and in turn have a great time. We strongly believe in teamwork and respect and know that through sport these kids are developing important life skills."',6,14,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-18',335.0,'per_session','$335','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-uw-parkside#session-79297-1212838',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','1b383af1-d660-4497-ad3a-044da3c091eb','nike-soccer-camp-at-university-of-wisconsin-parkside-june-15-18-2026-px16','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-84629a39-5979-501d-9ccb-4ae2aedb00e4','org-f52e9624-7f07-5c0f-910c-283cd85e8b76','nike-soccer-camp-north-greenville-university-residential-camp-ii-june-15-18-2026','Nike Soccer Camp North Greenville University - Residential Camp II (June 15ΓÇô18, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','This highΓÇæperformance soccer camp is designed for players ages 10ΓÇô18 and delivers elite training in a modern, stateΓÇæofΓÇætheΓÇæart facility setting. Campers benefit from topΓÇælevel fields and performance spaces that support technical growth, tactical development, and overall athletic progression. Led by the experienced NGU soccer staff, training sessions focus on technical skill development, tactical awareness, speed, agility, teamwork, and nutrition, while experiencing what it is like to be a college athlete by living on campus. PositionΓÇæspecific goalkeeper training is also available, ensuring specialized instruction for all players.The camp emphasizes highΓÇæquality coaching in a fun, supportive environment where athletes are encouraged to train freely, build confidence, and deepen their love for the game. Players leave energized, motivated, and better prepared to compete at the next level. Hear from Camp Director Sayit Mejia Bello: "Our goal is to help every player grow, not just in skill, but in confidence and love for the game through high-level coaching in a fun, competitive environment."',10,18,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-18',499.0,'per_session','$499','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-north-greenville#session-82285-1217463',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','915c578b-824f-4379-bd02-08446917269e','nike-soccer-camp-north-greenville-university-residential-camp-ii-june-15-18-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
