ame to the next level!',6,13,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-18',275.0,'per_session','$275-$365','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-minnesota-state-university-mankato',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','9ee8764e-1e89-4539-a10b-c40bd291b052','nike-soccer-camp-at-minnesota-state-university-mankato-june-15-18-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
