ir game and succeed at the next level! Hear from Coach Kyle Jones: ΓÇ£We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.ΓÇ¥',6,16,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-19',435.0,'per_session','$435','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-brookfield-sports-complex-wi#session-80863-1215445',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','f279f2b8-e7e8-4190-91b6-de19c535bc9e','nike-soccer-camp-at-brookfield-sports-complex-june-15-19-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
