step in their soccer journey, every aspect of the camp is thoughtfully designed to help players grow, thrive, and leave the field eager to come back. Join us this summer at Georgian Hills Park for a joyΓÇæfilled, developmentΓÇæcentered soccer experience where every player learns, grows, and leaves with newfound confidence and excitement for the beautiful game!',9,12,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-19',250.0,'per_session','$250','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-brookhaven-atlanta#session-81712-1216692',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','2d30c394-1692-4d8f-a876-1ad6f0fb088a','nike-soccer-camp-with-soccer-sidekicks-in-brookhaven-day-camp-june-15-19-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
