vate their game and succeed at the next level! Hear from Coach Kyle Jones: ΓÇ£We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.ΓÇ¥',6,16,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-19',549.0,'per_session','$549','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-lake-forest',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','a2e86335-18ea-4f53-a25f-22ddbb93bb71','nike-soccer-camp-at-lake-forest-academy-day-camp-i-june-15-19-2026-i1wx','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-750cf3dd-a822-5f44-a9da-080c3173c535','org-5ad6095e-ffb3-5c08-837a-49e93ccb6c12','nike-soccer-camp-at-seattle-university-all-skills-june-15-19-2026','Nike Soccer Camp at Seattle University - All Skills (June 15ΓÇô19, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Rich Schreiner was voted a Top-10 Nike Soccer Camp Director in 2025 by players and parents! Nike Soccer Camp at Seattle University offers players of all ages and abilities the opportunity to learn new skills, build passion for the game and take their performance to the next level. Players and Coaches of the Men''s and Women''s Soccer Team, Julie Woodward and Richard Schreiner, are excited to host camps this summer on the beautiful campus of Seattle University! Get the full camp experience and have fun while building the core fundamentals integrated within Nike Soccer Camps. Make friends and create memories with our team that will last a lifetime! Campers are trained by the Seattle University Men''s &amp; Women''s Soccer coaches and team. Come experience what itΓÇÖs like to be a part of the Redhawk Soccer Family!',5,12,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-19',329.0,'per_session','$329-$459','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-seattle-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','1617bde5-7492-49d1-bc00-70283402ec68','nike-soccer-camp-at-seattle-university-all-skills-june-15-19-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-d61dd15a-b265-5c75-b2b9-c62733e1a450','org-0d880199-8e75-55d9-b949-46bf41532c3e','san-francisco-soccer-camp-youth-academy-ii-june-15-19-2026','San Francisco Soccer Camp - Youth Academy II (June 15ΓÇô19, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','San Francisco Soccer Camp powered by Nike Soccer Camps, was voted as a Top-10 Nike Soccer Camp by parents in 2025(Top Camp in 2024)! Join us for an amazing week of camp at San Francisco Soccer Camp. Team up with Camp Director and 2023 Pac-12 Coach of the Year Leonard Griffin for the ultimate soccer training camp! San Francisco Soccer Camp (SFSC) offers so much more than your average soccer camp for players of all ability levels! Camps are led by a College Coaching Staff and additional support from elite college players to bring the camper-to-coach ratio down. A note from Leonard Griffin, Head Coach, CAL Men''s Soccer: "At the heart of our camp is the belief that high character leads to high performance. As a player, I saw firsthand how the most successful teams ΓÇö both in college and professionally ΓÇö were built on strong values, discipline, and teamwork. As a college coach, IΓÇÖve carried that lesson into every team IΓÇÖve led. ThatΓÇÖs why, when we brought the Cal MenΓÇÖs Soccer experience to San Francisco Soccer Camp, we knew character development had to be embedded into our program.But itΓÇÖs not just about building strong individuals; itΓÇÖs also about ensuring that the game remains fun. Just like with our college players, we make it a priority that every camper understands the joy of soccer. Too often, we see young athletes losing sight of why they fell in love with the game in the first place. At San Francisco Soccer Camp, we create a space where players can work hard, grow technically, and most importantly ΓÇö have fun. ItΓÇÖs that balance of passion, skill, character, and joy that makes our camp so unique."',5,9,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-19',719.0,'per_session','$719','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-san-francisco',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','7aa3df23-190f-4106-806b-6583029c1a2b','san-francisco-soccer-camp-youth-academy-ii-june-15-19-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
