it a priority that every camper understands the joy of soccer. Too often, we see young athletes losing sight of why they fell in love with the game in the first place. At San Francisco Soccer Camp, we create a space where players can work hard, grow technically, and most importantly ΓÇö have fun. ItΓÇÖs that balance of passion, skill, character, and joy that makes our camp so unique."',9,13,'all','2026-06-15','2026-06-19',719.0,'per_session','$719','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-san-francisco',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','2f029fab-a3e0-474d-abb1-f43cb79c8417','san-francisco-soccer-camp-junior-premier-ii-june-15-19-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
