pete alongside motivated peers, this overnight Nike Soccer Camp at UC Santa Cruz offers a summer experience that is as impactful as it is memorable.',9,18,'all','2026-06-21','2026-06-25',859.0,'per_session','$859','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-uc-santa-cruz#session-80796-1215353',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','79a6840f-5655-47e6-9520-8e686334d9a8','nike-soccer-camp-with-player-one-performance-uc-santa-cruz-june-21-25-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
