r compete alongside motivated peers, this overnight Nike Soccer Camp at UC Santa Cruz offers a summer experience that is as impactful as it is memorable.',9,18,'all','2026-06-21','2026-06-25',859.0,'per_session','$859-$1059','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-uc-santa-cruz',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','06608769-d0ff-4721-b310-97d41b43fd49','nike-soccer-camp-with-player-one-performance-uc-santa-cruz-june-21-25-2026-jhyw','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
