ut the most in campers regardless of whether they''re new to the game or already committed footballers."',6,13,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-25',409.0,'per_session','$409-$519','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-girls-soccer-camp-university-of-portland',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','b4434b48-e16a-4358-9825-791e0a3c3543','nike-girls-soccer-camp-at-university-of-portland-june-22-25-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-179c0868-b0c0-5de9-86ef-0244205b91ab','org-e0a6f03d-846c-5166-84d4-9a6fdb8544a1','nike-soccer-camp-at-lawrence-university-day-camp-june-22-25-2026','Nike Soccer Camp at Lawrence University - Day Camp (June 22ΓÇô25, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','With a variety of overnight and day camp options, field players and goalkeepers alike are able to find the best soccer training for their individual needs. The Complete Skills Camp helps players of all abilities develop athletically, refine fundamental soccer skills and enhance their skill set at their desired position. Throughout the camp, the coaches will implement a progressive curriculum focused on fun and skill development so each camper leaves the week having improved as a soccer player, had fun, and met new friends.',6,15,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-25',285.0,'per_session','$285-$399','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-lawrence-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','07c7c603-9f0a-4974-a2d2-35757cbb4fdc','nike-soccer-camp-at-lawrence-university-day-camp-june-22-25-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-91def404-6af7-5833-9c2f-b0c834a9b765','org-e6d834e1-479e-52d9-bc97-c940f605fc7a','nike-soccer-camp-at-jessup-university-day-camp-june-22-25-2026','Nike Soccer Camp at Jessup University - Day Camp (June 22ΓÇô25, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Come improve your game this summer at the Nike Soccer Camp at Jessup University in Rocklin, California. Hosted on JessupΓÇÖs campus at Jessup Field, this camp offers players the opportunity to train in a true college environment while experiencing what itΓÇÖs like to live and compete on a university campus. Campers receive highΓÇælevel instruction from the Jessup University soccer staff, focusing on fineΓÇætuning fundamentals, developing new skills, and improving tactical awareness through structured, gameΓÇæbased training sessions. Specialized programming is available for both youth players and high school athletes, ensuring ageΓÇæappropriate instruction and an optimal development pathway for every camper. Athletes can choose between day camp and overnight camp options, with the residential experience allowing players to fully immerse themselves in campus life while training like a collegiate athlete. Whether attending as a day camper or staying overnight, participants benefit from a positive, challenging environment designed to accelerate player growth, build confidence, and inspire a lasting love for the game.',8,18,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-25',489.0,'per_session','$489','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-william-jessup-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','32bdacf2-f4b3-44b5-8dd5-b705eeb681c8','nike-soccer-camp-at-jessup-university-day-camp-june-22-25-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
