school principals, teachers, and college professors. It makes for a well-rounded group that has expertise in working with children. This makes all aspects of the camp, from registration and check-in process, making the campers feel safe and comfortable, and emphasizing life skills."',4,14,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-26',429.0,'per_session','$429','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-furman-university#session-79589-1213282',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','1c40db25-7437-48dc-891d-f1198476180c','nike-soccer-camp-at-furman-university-june-22-26-2026-aeqb','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-479d13dc-c3ce-5462-81d8-f9e298402804','org-1c32e62f-7eb2-580f-92c7-0d924fe1dd69','nike-soccer-camp-in-lake-geneva-june-22-26-2026','Nike Soccer Camp in Lake Geneva -  (June 22ΓÇô26, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Soccer Skill Schools was voted a Top-10 Nike Soccer Camp in 2024 &amp; 2025 by players and parents! Join us for the Nike Soccer Camp in Lake Geneva with Kyle Jones, Director of Soccer Skill Schools. This camp welcomes players of all abilities, ages 6-16, to develop and refine their technical skills in a dynamic, competitive environment. It''s an exceptional opportunity for any player to train under top coaching professionals while having fun and pushing their game to the next level! Soccer Skill Schools'' "Numbers Approach Methodology" brings world-class skill development methods from Brazil, Holland, England, and Spain directly to the Midwest. The Soccer Skill School approach focuses on the individual player by guiding each athlete toward complete mastery of the ball, empowering them to make their own creative decisions, and equipping them with 65+ individual skills to win the one-on-one competitions that determine every game''s outcome. Led by experienced college coaches and current college players, the Soccer Skill Schools staff brings elite-level expertise and mentorship to every session. Training alongside coaches who compete at the collegiate level gives players invaluable insight into what it takes to elevate their game and succeed at the next level! Hear from Coach Kyle Jones: ΓÇ£We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.ΓÇ¥',6,16,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-26',465.0,'per_session','$465','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-lake-geneva-wisconsin#session-83768-1219482',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','4756ca0b-e1e1-44d2-9b7b-75af2a5a347c','nike-soccer-camp-in-lake-geneva-june-22-26-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-85ab2438-61b9-54f8-bb30-4c2527777d73','org-0802dd2f-6e79-5624-a05d-2f8d9eaad9b1','nike-soccer-camp-at-cabrillo-college-june-22-26-2026','Nike Soccer Camp at Cabrillo College -  (June 22ΓÇô26, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Get ready for an unforgettable summer of soccer at the Nike Soccer Camp at Cabrillo College in Aptos, California, a program so popular that many camp weeks have sold out the past two years! Boys and girls ages 7ΓÇô14 will train on the beautiful, stateΓÇæofΓÇætheΓÇæart fields of Cabrillo CollegeΓÇÖs stunning coastal campus, creating the perfect backdrop for elite coaching, highΓÇæenergy development, and nonstop fun. Led by Cabrillo College MenΓÇÖs Soccer Head Coach Paolo Carbone, this camp delivers a topΓÇætier training experience powered by a blend of timeΓÇætested methodologies and modern playerΓÇædevelopment techniques. Coach Carbone and his experienced staff create an environment where every athlete, whether brandΓÇænew to the game or pushing toward competitive levels, can confidently elevate skills, improve soccer IQ, and unlock their full potential. Each day features dynamic technical drills, fastΓÇæpaced activities, smallΓÇæsided games, and competitive gameplay designed to inspire creativity, sharpen decisionΓÇæmaking, and build a true love for the sport. Combined with Cabrillo CollegeΓÇÖs premium training facilities and an upbeat, supportive camp culture, this program offers one of the most exciting and soughtΓÇæafter youth soccer experiences in the Santa Cruz and Monterey Bay region. Join us this summer and experience why the Nike Soccer Camp at Cabrillo College continues to sell out every yearΓÇötrain with elite coaches, develop your game, and enjoy an unforgettable week of soccer excellence!',7,14,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-26',325.0,'per_session','$325','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-cabrillo-college#session-80567-1215045',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','f676fd2f-5ef9-46d8-929e-c3ee8f7bfa7f','nike-soccer-camp-at-cabrillo-college-june-22-26-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
