ces in the Santa Cruz and Monterey Bay region. Join us this summer and experience why the Nike Soccer Camp at Cabrillo College continues to sell out every yearΓÇötrain with elite coaches, develop your game, and enjoy an unforgettable week of soccer excellence!',7,14,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-26',435.0,'per_session','$435','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-cabrillo-college#session-80567-1215044',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','6e40ceca-5e58-4f38-ba27-037a7bcd275a','nike-soccer-camp-at-cabrillo-college-june-22-26-2026-ozlf','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
