igned to improve decision-making, technical ability, and performance under pressure. This camp is a great opportunity for young players in the Memphis area to learn, compete, and grow under experienced, passionate coaches while building confidence and a love for the game. Hear from Co-Owner of Prospect Soccer Academy and Camp Director Harry Forrester: "Our camps are delivered by seasoned professional players and coaches who bring real game experience into every session. Built around a proven, development-first philosophy, we prioritize technical excellence through high-repetition training and game-realistic scenarios such as 1v1 and 2v2, helping players build confidence, decision-making, and creativity under pressure. Just as important is the environment we create, structured, supportive, and professionally led, where players are encouraged to take risks, learn from mistakes, and grow. Our goal is for every player to leave not only as a more complete footballer, but with greater confidence, resilience, and a genuine love for the game.ΓÇ¥',6,14,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-26',385.0,'per_session','$385','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-memphis-tennessee#session-82764-1218120',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','01de9113-be21-4ac9-9254-2fd492f56652','nike-soccer-camp-with-prospect-soccer-academy-memphis-june-22-26-2026-unme','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-bcb7a4b6-f861-5b4e-9cec-dc0e16f3157d','org-0dc6daa2-6b94-58dd-ba57-bd6cf9f971dc','nike-soccer-camp-at-winsor-school-june-22-26-2026','Nike Soccer Camp at Winsor School -  (June 22ΓÇô26, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Train this summer at the Nike Soccer Camp on the prestigious Winsor School campus, an inspiring, beautiful setting right in the heart of Boston! This standout location offers the perfect backdrop for players to grow their skills, sharpen their technique, and enjoy an unforgettable week of soccer. Campers will focus on all aspects of the game through dynamic drills, positional training, and exciting scrimmages designed to challenge, motivate, and elevate every young athlete. A Step Ahead (ASA) Nike Soccer Camps are designed for the player looking to improve their game and soccer IQ. Emphasis is placed on fundamental development, shooting, offense/defense, team play, and more. Instruction is available to boys and girls, ages 7-16, playing at all levels, from beginner to advanced. Players are evaluated on the first day and placed in groups based on age and ability. Train hard, make friends, and enjoy an amazing soccer experience at the Nike Soccer Camp at Winsor School ΓÇô Boston!',7,16,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-26',499.0,'per_session','$499','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-winsor-school#session-79328-1212894',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','705ee498-455e-4808-8243-3e784df866bd','nike-soccer-camp-at-winsor-school-june-22-26-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
