Ös premier fields provides an inspiring environment where athletes can challenge themselves, make new friends, and experience a taste of collegiateΓÇælevel soccer. With elite coaching, exceptional facilities, and a curriculum designed to help players reach new heights, this camp delivers one of the most exciting youth soccer experiences in Adams County and the Central Pennsylvania region. Join us this summer and train with top college coaches as you take your game to the next level!',6,14,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-26',239.0,'per_session','$239','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-gettysburg-college-pa#session-82240-1217400',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','c59ae601-1f4c-4212-a617-15ce53ad4c22','nike-soccer-camp-at-gettysburg-college-june-22-26-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
