lege players, we make it a priority that every camper understands the joy of soccer. Too often, we see young athletes losing sight of why they fell in love with the game in the first place. At San Francisco Soccer Camp, we create a space where players can work hard, grow technically, and most importantly ΓÇö have fun. ItΓÇÖs that balance of passion, skill, character, and joy that makes our camp so unique."',9,13,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-26',719.0,'per_session','$719','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-san-francisco',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','f168194a-568e-4170-bfe5-41bc9b6bd0b7','san-francisco-soccer-camp-junior-premier-iii-sold-out-june-22-26-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-49eb2297-f4d3-5dd2-a84a-34ede7df89eb','org-ae4f109d-1e13-58d7-bbfd-da1a0f357abe','nike-soccer-camp-at-marquette-university-june-22-26-2026','Nike Soccer Camp at Marquette University -  (June 22ΓÇô26, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Take your game to the next level this summer at the Nike Soccer Camp at Marquette University in Milwaukee, Wisconsin. Open to players of all abilities, this camp offers a unique opportunity to train with Head Coach David Korn, a Top-10 Rated Nike Soccer Camp Director, along with Marquette University coaches and players, at Valley Fields, home of the Marquette Golden Eagles. Our staff is dedicated to helping each athlete grow in skill, confidence, character, and love for the game. Training sessions are designed to challenge experienced players while also supporting newer athletes through a strong foundation of ball skills and game understanding. Campers are grouped by age and ability to ensure the right level of development for every player. The curriculum blends technical training and tactical instruction with small-sided games and competitive scenarios that reinforce teamwork, decision-making, and overall game awareness. Beyond skill development, we emphasize character, leadership, and what it means to be a great teammate. This youth soccer camp in Milwaukee provides the perfect balance of high-level coaching and fun, giving players the chance to improve, compete, make friends, and create lasting summer memories. Hear from Men''s Head Coach &amp; Camp Director, David Korn: "Our staff is dedicated to helping each athlete progress to the next level of their game while growing in confidence, character, and love for the sport."',6,14,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-26',319.0,'per_session','$319-$439','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-marquette-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','9481cd0e-56e3-4eb5-9dae-b16f7cefec53','nike-soccer-camp-at-marquette-university-june-22-26-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-6cb2840b-58cb-5cd2-ab1f-7a578e239fdc','org-1c32e62f-7eb2-580f-92c7-0d924fe1dd69','nike-soccer-camp-in-lake-geneva-june-22-26-2026-6yn0','Nike Soccer Camp in Lake Geneva -  (June 22ΓÇô26, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Soccer Skill Schools was voted a Top-10 Nike Soccer Camp in 2024 &amp; 2025 by players and parents! Join us for the Nike Soccer Camp in Lake Geneva with Kyle Jones, Director of Soccer Skill Schools. This camp welcomes players of all abilities, ages 6-16, to develop and refine their technical skills in a dynamic, competitive environment. It''s an exceptional opportunity for any player to train under top coaching professionals while having fun and pushing their game to the next level! Soccer Skill Schools'' "Numbers Approach Methodology" brings world-class skill development methods from Brazil, Holland, England, and Spain directly to the Midwest. The Soccer Skill School approach focuses on the individual player by guiding each athlete toward complete mastery of the ball, empowering them to make their own creative decisions, and equipping them with 65+ individual skills to win the one-on-one competitions that determine every game''s outcome. Led by experienced college coaches and current college players, the Soccer Skill Schools staff brings elite-level expertise and mentorship to every session. Training alongside coaches who compete at the collegiate level gives players invaluable insight into what it takes to elevate their game and succeed at the next level! Hear from Coach Kyle Jones: ΓÇ£We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.ΓÇ¥',6,16,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-26',465.0,'per_session','$465','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-lake-geneva-wisconsin',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','d7eb2c55-1200-43e8-84cf-7a62ed5c5cfe','nike-soccer-camp-in-lake-geneva-june-22-26-2026-6yn0','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
