ck: "This isnΓÇÖt a traditional camp. We use NanoGames and real game-based coaching to develop smarter, more confident players. By focusing on the individual first, every player builds decision-making, connection, and a deeper love for the game. The focus doesn''t stop at your child as a player but also on developing a rounded person. Great people make great players."',5,14,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-26',349.0,'per_session','$349-$479','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-glendale-sports-complex',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','9de01b5d-c7a1-448f-91ca-640689e854e8','nike-soccer-camp-at-glendale-sports-complex-june-22-26-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
