table week filled with learning, excitement, and growth. Coach Luke Sheekey and Joe Ilett will also be running camps at Eckerd College in St. Petersburg! Details can be found HERE',5,14,'all','2026-06-22','2026-06-26',299.0,'per_session','$299-$445','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-st-petersburg-admiral-farragut-academy',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','8f2fd807-29fa-4755-b3d5-0bb61c803334','nike-soccer-camp-at-admiral-farragut-academy-june-22-26-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
