 of collegiate soccer. In addition, the Coed Day Camp provides a high-energy training option for boys and girls seeking elite instruction without the overnight stay, making it a great fit for younger athletes or local players. Across both camp options, athletes will develop their skills, raise their soccer IQ, and enjoy a week filled with competition, learning, and unforgettable moments. Whether youΓÇÖre aiming to sharpen your fundamentals or experience what itΓÇÖs like to train in a true college environment, the Nike Soccer Camp at Endicott College delivers a dynamic and memorable summer soccer experience. ΓÇ£As a player, it was always the people and the experience that made camp special. ThatΓÇÖs why our camp is built with a passion for the game and a focus on player development, helping athletes grow their skills, confidence, and a lasting love for the game in a positive, supportive environment.ΓÇ¥ ΓÇö Christine Silva, Camp Director and Former WomenΓÇÖs Associate Head Coach, Endicott College',8,14,'all','2026-06-25','2026-06-28',909.0,'per_session','$909','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-endicott-college-girls',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','3879fdc2-b21c-4bac-9a93-83b4dd7909ea','nike-soccer-camp-at-endicott-college-overnight-camp-june-25-28-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
