next level, the Nike Baseball Camp at Saint JosephΓÇÖs University is the perfect place to train, compete, and have fun this summer.',7,11,'all','2026-06-29','2026-07-02',259.0,'per_session','$259-$379','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-st-joseph-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','3e61dca6-6392-49be-ac1e-ef80aed70200','nike-baseball-camp-at-saint-joseph-s-university-june-29-july-2-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
