Golf, Softball, and Tennis) operating simultaneously. During the day, the athletes receive sport-specific coaching within their sport focus. In the evening, overnight campers across all sports come together for a special camp-wide experience which includes fun field games, educational seminars, and more. Baseball Complex/Transportation Information The camp will likely utilize the Denver Christian School Baseball Field (as it has in the past) for daily training. Campers and staff are transported by bus to and from the off-campus facilities for training each day. The 2026 athletic facilities will be confirmed in the spring. The Nike Baseball Camp at University of Denver is open to any and all entrants and limited only by number, age and gender. Athletic facilities and coaches are subject to change. The camp is not owned, sponsored, controlled or endorsed by University of Denver.',10,17,'all','2026-06-29','2026-07-02',939.0,'per_session','$939','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-university-of-denver',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','f6ce67c9-46f5-4920-8430-de8180dc9180','nike-baseball-camp-at-university-of-denver-overnight-camp-june-29-july-2-2026-4bu9','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-ccdc97fc-9503-5ee8-89f0-c88f362a7fae','org-1ab42458-e0b9-558b-b7bf-6979671e2609','nike-baseball-camp-at-san-marcos-high-school-june-29-july-2-2026-01ej','Nike Baseball Camp at San Marcos High School -  (June 29ΓÇôJuly 2, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["baseball_softball"]','Join our Nike Baseball Camp at San Marcos High School in Santa Barbara, California! Athletes of all abilities are encouraged to join us this winter to gain valuable baseball experience and create lasting memories. Quality facilities, knowledgeable coaches, and a positive environment are characteristics of this camp. Whether it be long-term or short-term goals you have set for yourself, Coach Tom Myers and staff are determined to help you get a step closer to your accomplishments. Directing the camp is Tom Myers, an Area Scout for the Los Angeles Dodgers. The goal is for every camper to take their game to the next level, create friendships, and have a great time.',8,10,'all','2026-06-29','2026-07-02',429.0,'per_session','$429','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-san-marcos-high-school',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','8ea60bdb-9392-4824-b7e1-a202fa956123','nike-baseball-camp-at-san-marcos-high-school-june-29-july-2-2026-01ej','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-8d6e1b82-ce24-5f3b-a5f4-2499d2e9dfb3','org-6e492842-0121-54f9-8b28-c55fd17cbe17','nike-baseball-camp-at-saint-joseph-s-university-june-29-july-2-2026-v6a6','Nike Baseball Camp at Saint JosephΓÇÖs University -  (June 29ΓÇôJuly 2, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["baseball_softball"]','Join us this summer at John W. Smithson Field on the campus of Saint JosephΓÇÖs University in Philadelphia, PA, for an exciting week of baseball development at the Nike Baseball Camp directed by SJU Head Coach Fritz Hamburg. This camp provides young athletes with high-level instruction, competitive drills, and a fun training environment designed to elevate their game. Coach Hamburg and his staff will offer two tailored divisions to ensure players train at the right pace and skill level: Beginner Division: Boys ages 7ΓÇô11 who are newer to the game and looking to build strong fundamentals.Intermediate Division: Boys ages 12ΓÇô14 with prior playing experience who want to sharpen their skills and improve their baseball IQ.Please note: This camp is not intended for high school players. Athletes can choose between full-day and half-day camp options, making it easy to find the perfect fit for your schedule and training needs. Each day will include position-specific instruction, hitting and fielding work, team challenges, and positive competitionΓÇöall led by experienced collegiate coaches committed to helping young players grow. Whether your athlete is taking their first steps in the sport or striving to reach the next level, the Nike Baseball Camp at Saint JosephΓÇÖs University is the perfect place to train, compete, and have fun this summer.',7,11,'all','2026-06-29','2026-07-02',259.0,'per_session','$259-$379','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-st-joseph-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','bbe3d12d-8e53-4582-b8a0-54710eac90e6','nike-baseball-camp-at-saint-joseph-s-university-june-29-july-2-2026-v6a6','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
