ty delivers a fun, competitive, and unforgettable summer camp experience.',6,17,'all','2026-07-05','2026-07-09',449.0,'per_session','$449','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-oregon-state-university#session-80989-1215655',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','46fff6d0-dec9-457f-93e1-851471bfb0da','nike-soccer-camp-at-oregon-state-university-july-5-9-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
