 alongside motivated peers, this overnight Nike Soccer Camp at UC Santa Cruz offers a summer experience that is as impactful as it is memorable.',9,18,'all','2026-07-05','2026-07-09',859.0,'per_session','$859','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-uc-santa-cruz#session-80797-1215355',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','83694b82-a732-442e-a984-5b28df2fb5d8','nike-soccer-camp-with-player-one-performance-uc-santa-cruz-july-5-9-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
