s one of the best soccer training experiences in New Jersey. "Most camps focus on activity, we focus on development. At Total Turf, every rep has purpose, every player is challenged, and every session is designed to build real confidence through preparation. This isnΓÇÖt about just showing up, itΓÇÖs about leaving better than you arrived." - Sean Matteo, Camp Director',6,16,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-09',285.0,'per_session','$285','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-total-turf-experience-pitman-nj#session-80873-1215462',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','0d5f4fa0-f5b5-4ddf-9821-d82004709792','nike-soccer-camp-at-total-turf-experience-july-6-9-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
