versity delivers a fun, competitive, and unforgettable summer camp experience.',6,17,'all','2026-07-05','2026-07-09',449.0,'per_session','$449-$919','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-oregon-state-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','8527c6cd-57aa-40cf-aaed-ab5a372922f2','nike-soccer-camp-at-oregon-state-university-july-5-9-2026-pm6m','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
