mpete alongside motivated peers, this overnight Nike Soccer Camp at UC Santa Cruz offers a summer experience that is as impactful as it is memorable.',9,18,'all','2026-07-05','2026-07-09',859.0,'per_session','$859-$1059','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-uc-santa-cruz',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','1e46336d-730f-4b90-8400-1f8760211b0f','nike-soccer-camp-with-player-one-performance-uc-santa-cruz-july-5-9-2026-6gft','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-6cef90ce-6f34-512c-90c7-4f4bc43f0d35','org-c5fb2105-193d-5c07-97a8-09d15db495ac','nike-soccer-camp-at-florida-international-university-july-5-9-2026','Nike Soccer Camp at Florida International University -  (July 5ΓÇô9, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["baseball_softball"]','This summer, the Nike Soccer Camp at Florida International University in Miami, FL offers boys and girls an unforgettable camp experience for players from the Southeast and beyond. Set on the vibrant FIU campus, campers train in a dynamic collegiate environment in the heart of Miami, combining high-level soccer development with one of the most exciting cities in the country. The experienced coaching staff are dedicated to helping each camper improve their skills in a fun, competitive, and safe environment. Training takes place on quality university athletic facilities, giving players a true college-style soccer experience while being surrounded by athletes who share the same passion for the game. Designed for U.S. and international players of all skill levels, this camp provides an excellent opportunity to develop technically, compete against strong talent, and prepare for the upcoming season. Campers will train, learn, and grow in a high-energy environment that emphasizes both individual development and team play. Off the field, players enjoy a well-rounded camp experience with evening activities and social events, creating a fun and memorable atmosphere. These activities are hosted in combination with the Nike Volleyball and Basketball camps running concurrently, adding to the energy and community feel across campusΓÇömaking this one of the standout summer experiences for multi-sport athletes. This camp is not affiliated with Florida International University, its staff, coaches, or athletics program.',8,18,'all','2026-07-05','2026-07-09',499.0,'per_session','$499-$899','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-miami-florida-international-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','3a1c19ba-62bb-4b9d-9cd7-f9a66b4551d8','nike-soccer-camp-at-florida-international-university-july-5-9-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
