he most in campers regardless of whether they''re new to the game or already committed footballers."',6,13,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-09',409.0,'per_session','$409-$519','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-girls-soccer-camp-university-of-portland',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','d82c7530-7cfc-4d52-a5d4-05b3ca410836','nike-girls-soccer-camp-at-university-of-portland-july-6-9-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
