occer. In addition, the Coed Day Camp provides a high-energy training option for boys and girls seeking elite instruction without the overnight stay, making it a great fit for younger athletes or local players. Across both camp options, athletes will develop their skills, raise their soccer IQ, and enjoy a week filled with competition, learning, and unforgettable moments. Whether youΓÇÖre aiming to sharpen your fundamentals or experience what itΓÇÖs like to train in a true college environment, the Nike Soccer Camp at Endicott College delivers a dynamic and memorable summer soccer experience. ΓÇ£As a player, it was always the people and the experience that made camp special. ThatΓÇÖs why our camp is built with a passion for the game and a focus on player development, helping athletes grow their skills, confidence, and a lasting love for the game in a positive, supportive environment.ΓÇ¥ ΓÇö Christine Silva, Camp Director and Former WomenΓÇÖs Associate Head Coach, Endicott College',7,13,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-09',499.0,'per_session','$499','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-endicott-college-girls',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','eb434422-e174-4238-b550-88f8be4d7d36','nike-soccer-camp-at-endicott-college-day-camp-july-6-9-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
