oach Kyle Jones: ΓÇ£We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.ΓÇ¥',6,16,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-10',355.0,'per_session','$355','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-davenport#session-79585-1213276',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','6c389b91-2919-44ef-8aac-8315fd88e6c9','nike-soccer-camp-in-davenport-july-6-10-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-2bef7034-18ee-513e-80b3-b5a9c20cc6bd','org-4b4840e8-220f-5d69-b4c3-b950c7435d2b','nike-girls-soccer-camp-at-fairfield-university-july-6-10-2026','Nike Girls Soccer Camp at Fairfield University -  (July 6ΓÇô10, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Experience an unforgettable week of soccer development at the Nike Girls Soccer Camp at Fairfield University, one of ConnecticutΓÇÖs premier destinations for young athletes! Designed for girls ages 6ΓÇô14, this camp takes place on FairfieldΓÇÖs beautiful campus, featuring stateΓÇæofΓÇætheΓÇæart athletic facilities that create the perfect environment for learning, competing, and having fun. Led by Associate Head WomenΓÇÖs Soccer Coach Corey Holton, along with an outstanding staff of collegiate coaches, campers will train under some of the regionΓÇÖs most respected teachers of the game. Coach Holton and her staff bring years of NCAA coaching expertise, delivering a highΓÇæenergy, confidenceΓÇæbuilding experience that empowers players at every level. Designed for girls ages 6ΓÇô14, this camp takes place on FairfieldΓÇÖs beautiful campus, featuring stateΓÇæofΓÇætheΓÇæart athletic facilities that create the perfect environment for learning, competing, and having fun. What makes this camp truly special is the staffΓÇÖs commitment to teaching the game the right way, blending proven fundamentals, modern training methods, and an encouraging approach that helps each player grow technically, tactically, and mentally. From dynamic drills to smallΓÇæsided games, every session is designed to elevate skills, boost creativity, and inspire a deeper love for the sport. A note from Corey Holton, Associate Women''s Head Coach, Fairfield University: ΓÇ£This isnΓÇÖt just another camp, itΓÇÖs a chance to see what the next level is really all about. Players train on a Division I campus, learning from a coaching staff that recruits and develops college athletes, alongside counselors who are currently playing at that level. Led by coaches with over 20 years of collegiate experience, the camp blends focused technical training with fun, competitive games. With a mix of individual ball work, small-sided games, and full-field play when possible, everything is designed to help players grow in confidence, sharpen their skills, and leave with a deeper understanding and love of the game.ΓÇ¥ Join us this summer at Fairfield University and take your game to the next level with topΓÇætier coaching, elite facilities, and the trusted Nike Soccer Camp experience!',6,14,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-10',389.0,'per_session','$389','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-girls-soccer-camp-fairfield-university#session-79685-1213455',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','48d90e94-5397-4ab7-a238-468ad8a96808','nike-girls-soccer-camp-at-fairfield-university-july-6-10-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-e5bb9c80-d56b-53d8-a1d7-e0ff26591216','org-e149d4af-c37a-5d67-a34b-9f43d6a81dcd','nike-soccer-camp-with-prospect-soccer-academy-laguna-niguel-july-6-10-2026','Nike Soccer Camp with Prospect Soccer Academy - Laguna Niguel -  (July 6ΓÇô10, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["baseball_softball"]','Join us for another amazing summer at the Nike Soccer Camp with Prospect Soccer Academy in Laguna Niguel, led by Coach Harry Forrester. Open to boys and girls ages 6ΓÇô14 of all ability levels, this camp provides an outstanding opportunity for players to develop their technical, tactical, and physical skills while enhancing their overall soccer IQ in a fun, supportive environment. Prospect Soccer Academy is Southern CaliforniaΓÇÖs premier development program, led by former professional players who run a full-time soccer academy in Orange County. With a proven track record of developing players at every level, the coaching staff brings elite playing experience and a modern, player-focused approach to each session. Conveniently located in Laguna Niguel, this camp is ideal for families across Orange County and surrounding communities seeking high-quality youth soccer training close to home. The curriculum blends proven fundamentals with innovative, game-based training to improve technical ability, decision-making, and confidence on the ball. Led by coaches who train players year-round, campers benefit from a consistent, high-level development model that emphasizes accountability, growth, and enjoyment of the game. Join us in Laguna Niguel for a fun and competitive week of soccer, build lasting friendships, and take your game to the next level. Hear from Co-Owner of Prospect Soccer Academy and Camp Director Harry Forrester: "Our camps are delivered by seasoned professional players and coaches who bring real game experience into every session. Built around a proven, development-first philosophy, we prioritize technical excellence through high-repetition training and game-realistic scenarios such as 1v1 and 2v2, helping players build confidence, decision-making, and creativity under pressure. Just as important is the environment we create, structured, supportive, and professionally led, where players are encouraged to take risks, learn from mistakes, and grow. Our goal is for every player to leave not only as a more complete footballer, but with greater confidence, resilience, and a genuine love for the game.ΓÇ¥ Prospect Soccer Academy will be hosting camps in multiple other locations Click here for more info',6,14,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-10',365.0,'per_session','$365','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-laguna-niguel-orange-county#session-82291-1217473',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','66f9ba6b-8817-47b1-92a1-ae8526276168','nike-soccer-camp-with-prospect-soccer-academy-laguna-niguel-july-6-10-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
