ls Program This Camp must comply with the regulations of the Massachusetts Department of Public Health and be licensed by the local Board of Health. Parents/Guardians will have the right to review background checks, healthcare and discipline policies, and grievance procedures upon request.',8,18,'all','2026-07-05','2026-07-10',909.0,'per_session','$909','https://www.ussportscamps.com/tennis/nike/tournament-challenge-camp-massachusetts#session-80330-1214724',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','6f2fab70-77d9-4ca0-bce9-1c1eb0e9b9d9','nike-tennis-camp-amherst-at-mount-holyoke-college-tournament-programs-tournament-3ey5','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
