 Coach Kyle Jones: ΓÇ£We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.ΓÇ¥',6,16,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-10',529.0,'per_session','$529','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-winnetka-il',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','2e8cc962-6858-49d3-bd62-42100c21a098','nike-soccer-camp-in-winnetka-july-6-10-2026-fj7n','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
