rom Coach Kyle Jones: ΓÇ£We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.ΓÇ¥',6,16,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-10',355.0,'per_session','$355','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-davenport',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','9107ff20-ce15-449a-a3fb-67091034f4bc','nike-soccer-camp-in-davenport-july-6-10-2026-a5iv','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
