iver and teach players all of the many life skills that the game has to offer, through: challenge, discipline, teamwork, self-expression, adversity, creativity and sportsmanship. Our curriculum is designed to teach fundamental to advanced soccer skills and techniques but also help players shine and step into the best versions of themselves each and every day."',8,16,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-10',295.0,'per_session','$295-$399','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-takoma-park-md',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','dee543db-e86c-4b41-852e-cd9a18fd0c01','nike-soccer-camp-at-takoma-park-july-6-10-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-9532bcc3-dd0e-53a9-a75a-eb141137f65a','org-df6ba419-55ac-5de2-aa53-24eb345919c8','nike-soccer-camp-at-fore-kicks-ii-sports-complex-july-6-10-2026','Nike Soccer Camp at Fore Kicks II Sports Complex -  (July 6ΓÇô10, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Come improve your skills with Nike Soccer Camp, at Fore Kicks II Sports Complex in Marlborough, MA this summer! Campers focus on all aspects of the game including refining fundamental skills and positional work through challenging exercises and scrimmages. A Step Ahead (ASA) Nike Soccer Camps are designed for players looking to improve their game and soccer IQ. Emphasis is placed on fundamental development, shooting, offense/defense, team play, and more. Instruction is available to boys and girls, playing at all levels, from beginner to advanced. Players are evaluated on the first day and placed in groups on age and ability.',7,16,'all','2026-07-06','2026-07-10',355.0,'per_session','$355-$485','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-fore-kicks-sports-complex',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','a3f7b2da-4289-4932-a73f-6cf40bdaddb5','nike-soccer-camp-at-fore-kicks-ii-sports-complex-july-6-10-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
