ael O''Neil: ΓÇ£Our residential camp blends elite training with unforgettable fun, giving players a true college-level experience while helping them grow in confidence, connection, and love for the game.ΓÇ¥',10,18,'all','2026-07-09','2026-07-11',489.0,'per_session','$489','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-girls-soccer-camp-at-niu-collegiate-experience#session-82307-1217502',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','a051a9c3-1ce5-44fd-a6ae-a188847dce5d','nike-girls-soccer-camp-at-northen-illinois-university-collegiate-experience-july','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
