er players ages 10ΓÇô16 to train in a FUN, engaging, and collegiate-level setting. Throughout the week, campers will develop new skills, refine techniques, expand their game knowledge, and enjoy the game alongside players from across the region.',10,16,'all','2026-07-12','2026-07-14',554.0,'per_session','$554','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-at-the-university-of-oklahoma#session-82751-1218099',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','87554533-3e9e-4700-b841-b53074de9161','nike-soccer-camp-in-norman-oklahoma-july-12-14-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
