, and controlled team scenarios help athletes apply their morning learning in real time. Coaches provide in-game instruction to improve reads, timing, pace, spacing, leadership, and communication.',5,9,'all','2026-07-13','2026-07-16',200.0,'per_session','$200','https://www.ussportscamps.com/basketball/nike/nike-basketball-camp-touch-shooting#session-79842-1213812',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','48996488-9c11-47b7-93f0-72717ea5f8d4','nike-basketball-camp-at-touch-shooting-jr-basketball-camp-july-13-16-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
