 University delivers a fun, competitive, and unforgettable summer camp experience.',6,17,'all','2026-07-12','2026-07-16',449.0,'per_session','$449-$919','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-oregon-state-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','bd748345-fd3d-4470-87c0-bf812bc01fd9','nike-soccer-camp-at-oregon-state-university-july-12-16-2026-22w0','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
