ike Volleyball and Basketball camps running concurrently, adding to the energy and community feel across campusΓÇömaking this one of the standout summer experiences for multi-sport athletes. This camp is not affiliated with Florida International University, its staff, coaches, or athletics program.',8,18,'all','2026-07-12','2026-07-16',499.0,'per_session','$499-$899','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-miami-florida-international-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','8636b27f-578e-4c4a-a587-403da0145d5b','nike-soccer-camp-at-florida-international-university-july-12-16-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
