ity is designed to improve how players think, move, and make decisions in the game, while building confidence and a genuine love for soccer. We create a high-energy, supportive environment where players are challenged, coached with purpose, and leave each day better than they arrived, both on and off the field." - Nick Woodruff, Camp Director &amp; Founder, Next Step Training',7,17,'all','2026-07-13','2026-07-16',335.0,'per_session','$335-$465','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-next-step-training-weymouth',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','24921f43-241f-45b7-8280-8e6784ff9634','nike-soccer-camp-with-next-step-training-weymouth-july-13-16-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-803a9bc2-78c0-591b-9b4e-2f0d5662828e','org-97a24624-ab03-5e5f-9945-2e6efdf9acd4','nike-soccer-camps-with-90-training-marietta-july-13-16-2026','Nike Soccer Camps with 90+ Training - Marietta -  (July 13ΓÇô16, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Join us for an amazing week at Nike Soccer Camp with 90+ Training in Marietta, GA. Led by Camp Directors Nate Johnson and Jake Sayer, this premier soccer skills camp delivers a high-level training experience focused on real player development. Proudly serving players from Cobb County and the greater Atlanta area. 90+ Training is a club-neutral program built on establishing strong technical foundations through consistent, high-quality repetitions. Campers train in a positive, competitive learning environment where players of all skill levels and experience can build confidence, improve decision-making, and deepen their understanding of the game. Designed as a thoughtful balance of fun and challenge, 90+ Training summer camps help players grow on and off the field. Our curriculum develops the complete player, enhancing soccer IQ, technical ability, physical performance, mental toughness, and social-emotional confidence. Academy or travel soccer experience is recommended for this camp.',6,16,'all','2026-07-13','2026-07-16',310.0,'per_session','$310-$430','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-marietta-ga',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','46a1918f-2e84-4cb1-a9c3-d4cac3eb793f','nike-soccer-camps-with-90-training-marietta-july-13-16-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
