r from Coach Kyle Jones: ΓÇ£We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.ΓÇ¥',6,16,'all','2026-07-13','2026-07-17',465.0,'per_session','$465','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-lake-geneva-wisconsin#session-79587-1213280',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','5b31d177-cef5-4f5e-a31c-6cde59631055','nike-soccer-camp-in-lake-geneva-july-13-17-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
