ls. Each week we focus on one core fundamental each day, like dribbling, turning, passing, receiving, and shooting, so players can really lock in and build confidence. More than anything, we want kids to leave camp smiling, proud of what they learned, and excited to come back the next day.ΓÇ¥ - Chris Bonawandt, Camp Director',6,16,'all','2026-07-13','2026-07-17',425.0,'per_session','$425','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-sofive-rancho-cucamonga#session-82120-1217229',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','0e562726-81bd-41e3-8067-e36bd689d01d','nike-soccer-camp-at-sofive-rancho-cucamonga-july-13-17-2026-5kg3','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-2674524d-d7a4-56c2-9953-f4ba4de9def6','org-1c15c471-7dbe-5c82-9db0-85e7762ec3dd','nike-soccer-camp-at-westmont-college-santa-barbara-overnight-i-july-12-17-2026','Nike Soccer Camp at Westmont College - Santa Barbara - Overnight I (July 12ΓÇô17, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Voted the #1 Nike Soccer Camp Director by parents and campers in 2025! (Top-10 in 2023/2024) Designed for coed players ages 9ΓÇô18, this premier overnight Nike Soccer Camp at Westmont College delivers elite training paired with a fully immersive residential experience on CaliforniaΓÇÖs Central Coast. Hosted on WestmontΓÇÖs scenic Santa Barbara campus, campers enjoy highΓÇæquality soccer facilities, comfortable onΓÇæcampus housing, and topΓÇætier amenities that create an environment built for growth both on and off the field. With previous camp sessions selling out year after year, demand for this experience continues to be extremely high. This summer marks an exciting evolution, as two respected Nike Soccer Camp programs on the Central Coast have officially come together to form one enhanced experience at Westmont College. The former Nike Vogelsinger Soccer Academy and The Soccer Academy Camp (previously held at Cate School) are now unified under one vision, creating a stronger, more impactful camp for every player. The camp is led by Ben Maxwell of Player ONE Performance, Northern CaliforniaΓÇÖs premier clubΓÇæneutral training program since 2017 and the #1 Nike Soccer Camp Director in the U.S. (2026). Ben brings proven leadership and continuity from both programs, delivering a playerΓÇæfocused training experience built on elite standards, high energy, and attention to detail. Campers follow a professionally designed curriculum emphasizing technical development, intelligent movement, goalΓÇæscoring, game awareness, and mental preparation, leaving camp more confident, sharper, and ready to compete at the next level. Whether players are looking to elevate their performance, build confidence, or train alongside highly motivated peers, the overnight Nike Soccer Camp at Westmont College offers a summer experience that is both developmentΓÇædriven and truly memorable.',9,18,'all','2026-07-12','2026-07-17',959.0,'per_session','$959','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-westmont-college-santa-barbara#session-81302-1216150',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','2b59bf45-20c4-4edc-a89a-6c2589d897d5','nike-soccer-camp-at-westmont-college-santa-barbara-overnight-i-july-12-17-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
