 (2026). Ben brings proven leadership and continuity from both programs, delivering a playerΓÇæfocused training experience built on elite standards, high energy, and attention to detail. Campers follow a professionally designed curriculum emphasizing technical development, intelligent movement, goalΓÇæscoring, game awareness, and mental preparation, leaving camp more confident, sharper, and ready to compete at the next level. Whether players are looking to elevate their performance, build confidence, or train alongside highly motivated peers, the overnight Nike Soccer Camp at Westmont College offers a summer experience that is both developmentΓÇædriven and truly memorable.',9,18,'all','2026-07-12','2026-07-17',1159.0,'per_session','$1159','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-westmont-college-santa-barbara#session-81302-1216151',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','24756280-77da-4e47-874e-dce2c1cff77a','nike-soccer-camp-at-westmont-college-santa-barbara-overnight-i-july-12-17-2026-5gkt','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-4d4dc2ed-02e0-53e9-98b4-fc315f41d230','org-944bf8ba-e3f4-51f8-b352-b058ec79ecf2','nike-soccer-camp-with-prospect-soccer-academy-lake-forest-july-13-17-2026','Nike Soccer Camp with Prospect Soccer Academy - Lake Forest -  (July 13ΓÇô17, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["baseball_softball"]','Join us for another amazing summer at the Nike Soccer Camp with Prospect Soccer Academy in Lake Forest, CA, led by Coach Harry Forrester. Open to boys and girls ages 6ΓÇô14 of all ability levels, this camp offers an outstanding opportunity for young players to develop their technical, tactical, and physical skills while improving their overall soccer IQ in a fun and supportive environment.Prospect Soccer Academy is the premier Southern California development program led by former professional players who run a full-time soccer academy dedicated to developing players of all ages and levels. With a wealth of playing and coaching experience, the staff brings a high-level, player-focused approach to every session.Held at Lake Forest Sports Park, one of Orange CountyΓÇÖs top soccer facilities, this camp provides a high-quality training environment that is both accessible and professional. Players benefit from a curriculum that blends proven fundamentals with modern, game-based training designed to build confidence, decision-making, and technical excellence.This is a great opportunity for any young player looking to learn, grow, and enjoy the game while training under experienced, passionate coaches in a positive and engaging environment.Hear from Co-Owner of Prospect Soccer Academy and Camp Director Harry Forrester: "Our camps are delivered by seasoned professional players and coaches who bring real game experience into every session. Built around a proven, development-first philosophy, we prioritize technical excellence through high-repetition training and game-realistic scenarios such as 1v1 and 2v2, helping players build confidence, decision-making, and creativity under pressure. Just as important is the environment we create, structured, supportive, and professionally led, where players are encouraged to take risks, learn from mistakes, and grow. Our goal is for every player to leave not only as a more complete footballer, but with greater confidence, resilience, and a genuine love for the game.ΓÇ¥ Prospect Soccer Academy will be hosting camps in multiple other locations Click here for more info.',6,14,'all','2026-07-13','2026-07-17',369.0,'per_session','$369','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-lake-forest-orange-county#session-82760-1218113',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','47db8945-322a-4fa4-8b0f-ad72252d73b8','nike-soccer-camp-with-prospect-soccer-academy-lake-forest-july-13-17-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
