h-energy atmosphereΓÇöall built to help players grow their confidence, sharpen their skills, and enjoy every day at camp.',6,12,'all','2026-07-13','2026-07-17',399.0,'per_session','$399','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-on-deck-prince-georges-county',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','9bcffc91-37f9-430a-bc6a-f9abf207176f','nike-baseball-camp-at-on-deck-in-prince-george-s-county-july-13-17-2026-uulb','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
