 (2026). Ben brings proven leadership and continuity from both programs, delivering a playerΓÇæfocused training experience built on elite standards, high energy, and attention to detail. Campers follow a professionally designed curriculum emphasizing technical development, intelligent movement, goalΓÇæscoring, game awareness, and mental preparation, leaving camp more confident, sharper, and ready to compete at the next level. Whether players are looking to elevate their performance, build confidence, or train alongside highly motivated peers, the overnight Nike Soccer Camp at Westmont College offers a summer experience that is both developmentΓÇædriven and truly memorable.',9,18,'all','2026-07-12','2026-07-17',959.0,'per_session','$959-$1159','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-westmont-college-santa-barbara',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','161265ce-9145-4f1a-84a8-2d8483c11f47','nike-soccer-camp-at-westmont-college-santa-barbara-overnight-i-july-12-17-2026-sleu','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-3b662b5c-14fc-552e-bcf2-0039ef5e5a34','org-7dcf7f33-6013-5bfd-ae84-cab6f6ae7794','nike-soccer-camp-in-whitefish-bay-july-13-17-2026','Nike Soccer Camp in Whitefish Bay -  (July 13ΓÇô17, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Take your game to the next level this summer at the Nike Soccer Camp in Whitefish Bay, Wisconsin, conveniently located near Glendale and the greater Milwaukee area. Open to players of all abilities, this camp offers a unique opportunity to train with Marquette University Head Coach David Korn, a Top 10 Nike Soccer Camp Director, along with his coaching staff and players in a high-energy, supportive environment. Our staff is dedicated to helping each athlete grow in skill, confidence, character, and love for the game. Training sessions are designed to challenge experienced players while also supporting newer athletes through a strong foundation of ball skills and game understanding. Campers are grouped by age and ability to ensure the right level of development for every player. The curriculum blends technical training and tactical instruction with small-sided games and competitive scenarios that reinforce teamwork, decision-making, and overall game awareness. Beyond skill development, we emphasize character, leadership, and what it means to be a great teammate. This youth soccer camp in Whitefish Bay, serving families in Glendale and the Milwaukee area, provides the perfect balance of high-level coaching and fun. Players will improve their skills, build confidence, make friends, and create lasting summer memories. Hear from Men''s Head Coach &amp; Camp Director, David Korn: "Our staff is dedicated to helping each athlete progress to the next level of their game while growing in confidence, character, and love for the sport."',6,14,'all','2026-07-13','2026-07-17',299.0,'per_session','$299-$399','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-whitefish-bay-wi',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','d2d43853-4d29-43ec-b549-8c045fe4d0e3','nike-soccer-camp-in-whitefish-bay-july-13-17-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
