etime. Hear directly from Coach Cobrin Bowers: "Our camp is a true balance of skill development, learning within the game, and having as much fun as possible. Players will learn a variety of skills, get to apply them in game-like scenarios, and boost their soccer confidence on a daily basis. We want everyone that joins us for camp to feel like they had the best soccer week of the summer and will be itching to come back year after year." DonΓÇÖt miss your chance to train with championshipΓÇæcaliber coaches in Charleston, WV, secure your spot today!',6,16,'all','2026-07-13','2026-07-17',255.0,'per_session','$255-$355','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-university-of-charleston-wv',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','e4f582e4-2825-464e-b752-77e3933923c3','nike-soccer-camp-at-university-of-charleston-july-13-17-2026-ava6','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
