y technical and tactical instruction rooted in collegiate standards, while providing campers with an unmatched college soccer and studentΓÇæathlete experience. Designed for players of all experience levels, this girlsΓÇæonly camp blends competitive training with a positive, empowering atmosphere that encourages leadership, resilience, and selfΓÇæbelief. With its outstanding facilities, supportive coaching, and true collegeΓÇæstyle immersion, the Nike Girls Soccer Camp at McDaniel College continues to be a summer highlight, creating lasting memories while helping players prepare for their next level, both in soccer and in life. ΓÇ£Our camp provides a personal experience for every camper. Our coaches and counselors work hard to connect with each player and create an environment where learning and fun go hand in hand. Older players also have the opportunity to expand their soccer knowledge by learning directly from college coaches as they prepare for their upcoming high school season.ΓÇ¥ ΓÇö Sandy Lagana Bly, Camp Director &amp; Associate Athletic Director, McDaniel College',14,18,'all','2026-07-16','2026-07-19',579.0,'per_session','$579-$669','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-mcdaniel-college',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','0d808913-d0ce-4d3c-815a-c6fa1a9ee3ab','nike-girls-soccer-camp-at-mcdaniel-college-high-school-prep-camp-july-16-19-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-c3997ad0-2af8-5317-86f4-28ab5f56ecc3','org-b6964a32-9ac3-5362-8ca7-feb8ad27769a','nike-soccer-camp-at-benedictine-university-july-17-19-2026-8yxt','Nike Soccer Camp at Benedictine University -  (July 17ΓÇô19, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Coach Dave DiTomasso has partnered with Spencer Pappas, Head MenΓÇÖs Soccer Coach at Benedictine University, to offer an exceptional collegiate overnight camp experience at Benedictine University this summer. Now hosted on the Benedictine University campus, this camp provides players with a true college soccer environmentΓÇötraining on quality facilities and experiencing life in a collegiate setting. Please note, this camp was formerly held at Elmhurst University with Coach DiTomasso and has been regarded as one of the premier soccer camps in the region for decades. Designed for aspiring players, this camp is an outstanding opportunity to strengthen fundamentals and elevate overall performance. Instruction emphasizes functional training, attacking and supporting play, decision-making, finishing, defending, small-sided games, 11v11 play, and creativity. Dedicated goalkeeper training is also provided, ensuring every player receives position-specific development. With a fully immersive overnight experience, campers gain a valuable introduction to college life, staying in residence halls, training daily in a structured collegiate environment, and building connections with players from across the region. This experience is ideal for young athletes looking to understand what it takes to compete and succeed at the next level. Open to players ages 8ΓÇô18, with overnight eligibility beginning at age 9 (8-year-olds are welcome as extended day campers). Coach DiTomassoΓÇÖs camp was also recognized as one of North AmericaΓÇÖs Top 60 Summer Camps of 2017 by FlightNetwork travel agency, highlighting its long-standing reputation for quality instruction and player development.',8,18,'all','2026-07-17','2026-07-19',539.0,'per_session','$539-$629','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-benedictine-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','18b793ea-702d-4799-a131-883fdd912ab0','nike-soccer-camp-at-benedictine-university-july-17-19-2026-8yxt','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-c9c04526-d16f-5d28-9b09-a6c95e1986c7','org-356db091-0b55-51fe-9d0a-ac5e9d00be17','nike-boys-soccer-camp-at-rollins-college-july-18-21-2026','Nike Boys Soccer Camp at Rollins College -  (July 18ΓÇô21, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Join us for the Nike Boys Soccer Camp at Rollins College in Winter Park, Florida, just outside of Orlando, where players train in a true collegiate environment with one of the nationΓÇÖs top programs. Led by Head MenΓÇÖs Soccer Coach Keith Buckley and the Rollins College coaching staff, this camp offers athletes the opportunity to experience collegeΓÇælevel training while developing their game at a higher level. Training sessions blend traditional and modern coaching methodologies, focusing on technical refinement, tactical understanding, and intelligent decisionΓÇæmaking in gameΓÇælike situations. The curriculum is designed to challenge players and help every camper continue progressing toward the next level of play in a competitive, supportive atmosphere. In addition to elite onΓÇæfield training, the camp includes a college recruiting seminar, giving players valuable insight into the recruitment process and what it takes to play soccer at the collegiate level. Athletes leave camp with improved skills, greater soccer IQ, and a clearer understanding of the demands of highΓÇælevel soccer. The Nike Boys Soccer Camp at Rollins College delivers a meaningful collegiate training experience that prepares motivated players to grow, compete, and take the next step in their soccer journey.',10,18,'all','2026-07-18','2026-07-21',599.0,'per_session','$599-$699','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-rollins-college',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','09fb8c08-c159-4ea6-a3bd-111c7c561a9c','nike-boys-soccer-camp-at-rollins-college-july-18-21-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
