ersity delivers a fun, competitive, and unforgettable summer camp experience.',6,17,'all','2026-07-19','2026-07-23',449.0,'per_session','$449','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-oregon-state-university#session-80992-1215664',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','c8a28d40-5494-4280-bf15-8355337e0be4','nike-soccer-camp-at-oregon-state-university-july-19-23-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
