r compete alongside motivated peers, this overnight Nike Soccer Camp at UC Santa Cruz offers a summer experience that is as impactful as it is memorable.',9,18,'all','2026-07-19','2026-07-23',1059.0,'per_session','$1059','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-uc-santa-cruz#session-80798-1215358',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','cf3fa2bd-c856-455c-88dc-1ab3dead35e5','nike-soccer-camp-with-player-one-performance-uc-santa-cruz-july-19-23-2026-z1d5','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
