 impactful camp experience. Giveaways, prizes, and awards will be earned throughout the week, and all campers receive a Marquette Soccer t-shirt.',9,15,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-23',539.0,'per_session','$539','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-elite-boys-soccer-camp-marquette-university#session-84570-1220580',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','694b342d-ddbe-406e-a398-6bc60908ab22','marquette-university-elite-boys-overnight-nike-soccer-camp-july-20-23-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
