and includes daytime training only. Campers can bring their own lunch or purchase on campus. The day camp program is open to boys ages 8-17. Nike Sports Camp Experience Nike Sports Camps offers a unique experience in Bend with many sports - Baseball, Cross Country, Golf (Coming Soon!), Soccer, Softball, Tennis, and Track &amp; Field - operating simultaneously. During the day, the athletes receive sport-specific coaching within their sport focus. In the evening, overnight campers across all sports come together for a special camp-wide experience which includes fun field games, educational seminars, and more. Baseball Complex/Transportation Information The camp will likely utilize the Big Sky Park Baseball Fields or Summit High School (as it has in the past) for daily training. Campers and staff are transported by bus to and from the off-campus facilities for training each day. The 2026 athletic facilities will be confirmed in the spring. The Nike Baseball Camp in Bend is open to any and all entrants and limited only by number, age and gender. Athletic facilities and coaches are subject to change. The camp is not owned, sponsored, controlled or endorsed by Central Oregon Community College.',10,17,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-23',939.0,'per_session','$939','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-bend',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','4b9ba7c6-7616-483f-8bf6-426650b9b219','nike-baseball-camp-in-bend-overnight-camp-july-20-23-2026-20qz','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-10ed8629-6d83-5231-b248-0bcb0cfa6994','org-c527ea1f-2282-5db8-85f6-2204eecb55d7','nike-baseball-camp-at-southern-new-hampshire-university-july-20-23-2026','Nike Baseball Camp at Southern New Hampshire University -  (July 20ΓÇô23, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["baseball_softball"]','Get ready for a great baseball experience at the Nike Baseball Camp at Southern New Hampshire University in Manchester, NH! This camp offers young athletes the perfect opportunity to sharpen their skills, learn from top coaches, and have a blast on the field. Campers will develop their hitting, fielding, and base-running techniques through high-energy drills and fun, competitive playΓÇöand theyΓÇÖll leave with more confidence and excitement for the game than ever before. WeΓÇÖre thrilled to welcome everyone back for two great weeks of camp in 2026! Former SNHU Head Coach Scott Loiseau will lead camp activities, supported by the talented Penmen coaching staff and players. Designed for athletes ages 6ΓÇô12, the camp groups players by age and ability to ensure personalized instruction and growth for every level. The focus is on building strong fundamentals, teamwork, and a deeper love for the game. Spots fill up fastΓÇödonΓÇÖt miss your chance to join the fun!',6,12,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-23',399.0,'per_session','$399','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-southern-new-hampshire-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','a44e