ike Volleyball and Basketball camps running concurrently, adding to the energy and community feel across campusΓÇömaking this one of the standout summer experiences for multi-sport athletes. This camp is not affiliated with Florida International University, its staff, coaches, or athletics program.',8,18,'all','2026-07-19','2026-07-23',499.0,'per_session','$499-$899','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-miami-florida-international-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','63527395-fff2-4a46-88f1-a578b667649f','nike-soccer-camp-at-florida-international-university-july-19-23-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-db1f3777-b958-5834-aa41-2939b6658249','org-8a8c579f-dece-5bdf-b9a7-63cccfdcd7da','nike-soccer-camp-at-concordia-university-st-paul-july-20-23-2026-hf0g','Nike Soccer Camp at Concordia University - St. Paul -  (July 20ΓÇô23, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','The Nike Soccer Camp at Concordia University - St. Paul, Minnesota is directed by the Women''s Head Coach Steve Bellis, who will be accompanied by his coaching staff.The camp is designed for boys and girls, of all abilities, ages 6-16, to develop athletically, refine their fundamental skills and enhance their technique, players will also get to develop position-specific skills via focused training. An amazing opportunity for any player to learn from a top college coaching staff and supplement their training in a fun and competitive setting!',6,16,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-23',345.0,'per_session','$345-$465','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-concordia-university-st-paul',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','eeb61e15-84db-4aed-846c-8447092282c5','nike-soccer-camp-at-concordia-university-st-paul-july-20-23-2026-hf0g','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-1c333236-ca54-58f6-866a-308984482c0b','org-e5c30c6a-3699-5972-83a8-8bb103f65f1b','marquette-university-elite-boys-overnight-nike-soccer-camp-july-20-23-2026-bsde','Marquette University Elite Boys Overnight Nike Soccer Camp -  (July 20ΓÇô23, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','The Marquette University Elite Boys Soccer Camp, held at the prestigious St. JohnΓÇÖs Northwestern Academy, offers both overnight and commuter options and is designed to provide a fun, challenging, and competitive environment for ambitious soccer players ages 9ΓÇô15. Campers receive direct instruction from Marquette University coaches and players, along with a select group of hand-picked staff. The camp features a blend of high-level training sessions and full-sided matches, allowing players to sharpen their skills and apply them in realistic game settings. A structured goalkeeper curriculum is also included. Our goal is for every camper to have a memorable experience alongside friends and teammates while competing against top youth talent from across the area and the Midwest. The state-of-the-art facilities at St. JohnΓÇÖs Northwestern Academy provide the perfect backdrop for development, competition, and fun. At the core of our camp is a strong commitment to player development. Our staff is dedicated to helping each athlete progress to the next level of their game while growing in confidence, character, and love for the sport. We understand the investment families make and strive to deliver a high-quality, impactful camp experience. Giveaways, prizes, and awards will be earned throughout the week, and all campers receive a Marquette Soccer t-shirt.',9,15,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-23',539.0,'per_session','$539-$659','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-elite-boys-soccer-camp-marquette-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','5ee92c79-8b0a-4272-ac49-10e9bb308fec','marquette-university-elite-boys-overnight-nike-soccer-camp-july-20-23-2026-bsde','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-89a5bf47-d55b-5326-81c4-4b8bb40cd226','org-c7ca869b-55b8-5307-a4ff-fc45ea503fe0','nike-soccer-camp-with-next-step-training-tewksbury-july-20-23-2026','Nike Soccer Camp with Next Step Training - Tewksbury -  (July 20ΓÇô23, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Next Step Training was voted a top 10 Nike Soccer Camp in 2025 by players and parents! Next Step''s soccer camps provide exceptional coaching and a welcoming atmosphere that helps players of all levels grow. With engaging drills, supportive instructors, and a strong emphasis on teamwork, it creates an exciting environment where kids can build confidence, improve their skills, and have a great time on the field. Join us for an amazing week of camp at the Nike Soccer Camp with Next Step Training in Tewksbury, MA. Team up with Camp Director Nicholas Woodruff for the ultimate soccer training camp! Next Step Training was founded in order to provide a unique competitive experience for the BEST local kids in and around the Southeastern Massachusetts/Rhode Island area. The combination of high-level coaching, invite-only environments, and a true club-neutral philosophy makes Next Step one of the most elite supplemental training experiences in New England. The overall goal of each training session is to provide technical, tactical, and mental growth while encouraging players to be creative to help them become the most complete version of themselves. "At Next Step Soccer, our camps are built around one simple idea, develop the player, not just the session. Every activity is designed to improve how players think, move, and make decisions in the game, while building confidence and a genuine love for soccer. We create a high-energy, supportive environment where players are challenged, coached with purpose, and leave each day better than they arrived, both on and off the field." - Nick Woodruff, Camp Director &amp; Founder, Next Step Training',5,17,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-23',315.0,'per_session','$315-$435','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-next-step-training-tewksbury',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','dbb71460-aa3d-4091-a4d0-abfdc207c523','nike-soccer-camp-with-next-step-training-tewksbury-july-20-23-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-2abbd084-3b04-5e08-8cee-5de1fa07b1cc','org-c952853c-0ca6-5e4f-9793-f50ab8886f6e','nike-soccer-camp-at-worcester-state-university-july-20-23-2026','Nike Soccer Camp at Worcester State University -  (July 20ΓÇô23, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Come improve your skills with Nike Soccer Camp at Worcester State University! Campers focus on all aspects of the game including refining fundamental skills and positional work through challenging exercises and scrimmages. A Step Ahead (ASA) Nike Soccer Camps are designed for a player looking to improve their game and soccer IQ. Emphasis is placed on fundamental development, shooting, offense/defense, team play, and more. Instruction is available to boys and girls, playing at all levels, from beginner to advanced. Players are evaluated on the first day and placed in groups on age and ability. Improve your skills and meet new friends this summer at the Nike Soccer Camp at Worcester State University!',7,16,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-23',305.0,'per_session','$305-$405','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-worcester-state-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','9ac35486-4bf9-4211-a534-d19e81e7406f','nike-soccer-camp-at-worcester-state-university-july-20-23-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
