ge players, we make it a priority that every camper understands the joy of soccer. Too often, we see young athletes losing sight of why they fell in love with the game in the first place. At San Francisco Soccer Camp, we create a space where players can work hard, grow technically, and most importantly ΓÇö have fun. ItΓÇÖs that balance of passion, skill, character, and joy that makes our camp so unique."',9,13,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-24',719.0,'per_session','$719','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-san-francisco',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','53162048-4cee-45d1-9594-0c01597cafc2','san-francisco-soccer-camp-junior-premier-vi-sold-out-july-20-24-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-108350b3-d811-5a73-964e-511d7190fe83','org-b5b6eefb-798b-5a0b-8213-c10ae50bb042','nike-soccer-camp-at-occidental-college-july-20-24-2026','Nike Soccer Camp at Occidental College -  (July 20ΓÇô24, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Join us for an exciting week at Nike Soccer Camp at Occidental College in Los Angeles, CA, home to one of the most respected collegiate soccer environments in Southern California. Campers will train under Camp Director Rod Lafaurie and the Occidental MenΓÇÖs Soccer staff, recently named SCIAC Coaching Staff of the Year, and recognized nationally with a Top-10 Rated Director Award.Set on the beautiful Occidental College campus, this camp offers a true collegiate training experience, giving players access to high-quality facilities and an inspiring college soccer setting in the heart of Los Angeles.The curriculum blends traditional and modern coaching methodologies to help every player take the next step in their development. Players will build core technical skills, improve tactical understanding, and elevate their overall soccer IQ in a fun, structured, and competitive environment. Summer sessions also include access to the on-campus swimming pool, rounding out the full camp experience.Whether your child is just beginning their soccer journey or looking to sharpen competitive edge, this Nike Soccer Camp delivers a high-level and memorable experience where players grow their game, build confidence, and form lasting friendships.Hear from Rod Lafaurie: "Our goal is simple: we want every player to feel safe, have fun, and love every day they spend with us. By training within a curriculum designed by college soccer coaches and utilizing our elite facilities, from the field to the pool, we create a high-energy environment that challenges players to grow. We pride ourselves on clear communication and a development-focused approach that builds technical skills and character, ensuring your child leaves with a deeper love for the game and the confidence to take their next step in soccer."',6,16,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-24',345.0,'per_session','$345-$465','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-los-angeles-occidental-college',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','d73821e2-9174-413f-8432-1a2dd7eb4133','nike-soccer-camp-at-occidental-college-july-20-24-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-d6902287-d307-509d-a220-47f0115dbec8','org-4b4342bb-5d74-5483-af40-e990256c7077','nike-soccer-camp-at-biola-university-july-20-24-2026-n8l7','Nike Soccer Camp at Biola University -  (July 20ΓÇô24, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Join us for another amazing summer of camp with Men''s Soccer Head Coach Joey O''Keefe at the Nike Soccer Camp at Biola University. At camp, each athlete will be able to improve their technical, tactical, and physical tools while enhancing their soccer IQ. The camp is open to boys and girls, of all abilities ages 6-16. This is an amazing opportunity for any young soccer player to develop their game under the watchful eye of accomplished and passionate coaches in a fun and inviting environment.',6,16,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-24',335.0,'per_session','$335-$455','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-biola-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','5549fe49-c7ae-4c2b-8582-f5c853170742','nike-soccer-camp-at-biola-university-july-20-24-2026-n8l7','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-b17ae444-40bc-5c43-8ce4-86c2c20ac4df','org-389ac2cf-70b0-517a-8407-006f12cf2b1a','nike-soccer-camp-at-eckerd-college-july-20-24-2026','Nike Soccer Camp at Eckerd College -  (July 20ΓÇô24, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Join us for an unforgettable week of soccer this summer at the Nike Soccer Camp at Eckerd College, led by CoΓÇæDirectors Luke Sheekey, Head WomenΓÇÖs Soccer Coach, and Joe Illett, Head MenΓÇÖs Soccer Coach at Eckerd College. Both Luke and Joe are highly respected youthΓÇædevelopment coaches with decades of experience and a proven track record of delivering camps that blend modern coaching methodologies with a fun, competitive atmosphere. This camp is designed for players of all ages and skill levels, offering a dynamic mix of technical training, smallΓÇæsided games, positional development, and highΓÇæenergy competitions. The curriculum emphasizes modern, playerΓÇæcentric instruction, helping athletes sharpen fundamental skills, improve decisionΓÇæmaking, and deepen their understanding of the game while enjoying a positive and supportive environment. Campers will also enjoy the outstanding facilities at Eckerd College, including pristine naturalΓÇægrass fields, shaded waterfront areas perfect for breaks and lunch, and covered spaces ideal for smallΓÇæsided games. To help players stay cool and comfortable during the Florida summer, campers will also have access to the Eckerd College pool, providing a refreshing way to beat the heat while keeping the experience fun and safe. Whether your player is just getting started or preparing for higherΓÇælevel play, this camp offers a memorable, actionΓÇæpacked week of development, connection, and growth on the beautiful waterfront campus of Eckerd College. Coach Luke Sheekey and Joe Illet will also be running camps at Admiral Farragut Academy in St. Petersburg! Details can be found HERE',5,14,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-24',299.0,'per_session','$299-$445','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-eckerd-college',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','53fa7038-08a2-445f-b09f-607952d498ae','nike-soccer-camp-at-eckerd-college-july-20-24-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-52c94abe-0467-5598-a51a-a06a3bb08562','org-904323b8-de9e-516a-8009-2f0dd81d3b9d','nike-soccer-camp-in-winnetka-july-20-24-2026-dnta','Nike Soccer Camp in Winnetka -  (July 20ΓÇô24, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Soccer Skill Schools was voted a Top-10 Nike Soccer Camp in 2024 &amp; 2025 by players and parents! Join us for the Nike Soccer Camp in Winnetka with Kyle Jones, Director of Soccer Skill Schools. This camp welcomes players of all abilities, ages 6-16, to develop and refine their technical skills in a dynamic, competitive environment. It''s an exceptional opportunity for any player to train under top coaching professionals while having fun and pushing their game to the next level! Soccer Skill Schools'' "Numbers Approach Methodology" brings world-class skill development methods from Brazil, Holland, England, and Spain directly to the Midwest. The Soccer Skill School approach focuses on the individual player by guiding each athlete toward complete mastery of the ball, empowering them to make their own creative decisions, and equipping them with 65+ individual skills to win the one-on-one competitions that determine every game''s outcome. Led by experienced college coaches and current college players, the Soccer Skill Schools staff brings elite-level expertise and mentorship to every session. Training alongside coaches who compete at the collegiate level gives players invaluable insight into what it takes to elevate their game and succeed at the next level! Hear from Coach Kyle Jones: ΓÇ£We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.ΓÇ¥',6,16,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-24',529.0,'per_session','$529','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-winnetka-il',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','7f3f7960-f317-4600-b491-fef8ae60b6b4','nike-soccer-camp-in-winnetka-july-20-24-2026-dnta','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
