 skill development, players will build confidence, improve their soccer fundamentals, learn teamwork and sportsmanship, and develop a lasting love for the game in a safe and encouraging environment."',6,14,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-24',335.0,'per_session','$335','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-st-charles-il',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','533a1dd1-6f13-48e1-82f0-45c895b89888','nike-soccer-camp-in-st-charles-july-20-24-2026-1jkd','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
