eliver and teach players all of the many life skills that the game has to offer, through: challenge, discipline, teamwork, self-expression, adversity, creativity and sportsmanship. Our curriculum is designed to teach fundamental to advanced soccer skills and techniques but also help players shine and step into the best versions of themselves each and every day."',8,16,'all','2026-07-20','2026-07-24',295.0,'per_session','$295-$399','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-takoma-park-md',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','42c6d6e4-99b3-4df8-8731-26ef07e393de','nike-soccer-camp-at-takoma-park-july-20-24-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
