t. Campers take part in classroom sessions focused on leadership, mentality, nutrition, and game strategy, gaining tools that support both athletic and personal growth. Recovery sessions help players stay fresh throughout the week, while guest speakers provide inspiration and realΓÇæworld insight into the soccer pathway. Off the field, campers enjoy pool time, indoor futsal, and structured evening activities, designed to beat the Las Vegas heat while keeping athletes active, connected, and energized. Surrounded by worldΓÇæclass facilities and the excitement of the UNLV campus, this overnight soccer camp offers young players a complete, memorable summer experience, combining elite youth coaching, outstanding amenities, and a vibrant residential setting that supports development on and off the pitch.',10,16,'all','2026-07-23','2026-07-26',499.0,'per_session','$499','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-university-nevada-las-vegas#session-80592-1215081',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','856a491e-7e1d-4f14-a564-128ada187ec7','nike-soccer-camp-at-university-of-nevada-las-vegas-july-23-26-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
