g, helping players improve their game, build confidence, and create lasting memories.',9,16,'all','2026-07-26','2026-07-29',679.0,'per_session','$679-$789','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-rider-university',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','89ea0d7a-caf1-4d3a-96aa-fe59e9de8ee7','nike-soccer-camp-at-rider-university-july-26-29-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
