e game, while building confidence and a genuine love for soccer. We create a high-energy, supportive environment where players are challenged, coached with purpose, and leave each day better than they arrived, both on and off the field." - Nick Woodruff, Camp Director &amp; Founder, Next Step Training',7,17,'all','2026-07-27','2026-07-30',299.0,'per_session','$299-$415','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-next-step-training-cumberland',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','b1fd624e-3640-46ee-967f-25c189b6ebe2','nike-soccer-camp-with-next-step-training-cumberland-july-27-30-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
