olyoke - All Skills Program This Camp must comply with the regulations of the Massachusetts Department of Public Health and be licensed by the local Board of Health. Parents/Guardians will have the right to review background checks, healthcare and discipline policies, and grievance procedures upon request.',13,18,'all','2026-07-19','2026-07-31',1759.0,'per_session','$1759','https://www.ussportscamps.com/tennis/nike/tournament-challenge-camp-massachusetts#session-80318-1214699',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','644fca21-1318-40da-a9df-a66dc40b9134','nike-tennis-camp-amherst-at-mount-holyoke-college-tournament-programs-tournament-wt9g','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
