,'2026-07-31',299.0,'per_session','$299','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-swim-camp-hub-sports-windgate-ranch-scottsdale',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','35c0f091-6395-4369-a4fe-16e004bf4951','nike-soccer-swim-camp-with-hub-sports-at-windgate-ranch-july-27-31-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-1bf0525c-edd8-56f3-aacc-3bd6f0e4495b','org-438ea805-5df1-5c0a-a7a7-2444d38d6ea5','nike-soccer-camp-at-sofive-rancho-cucamonga-july-27-31-2026-mr0w','Nike Soccer Camp at Sofive Rancho Cucamonga -  (July 27ΓÇô31, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Experience elite training this summer at the Nike Soccer Camp at Sofive Rancho Cucamonga, powered by the regionally respected playerΓÇædevelopment expertise of Coach Chris Bonawandt and his renowned Los Angeles Soccer Camp organization. Known across the Los Angeles area for producing confident, technically skilled players and running some of the regionΓÇÖs most trusted youth soccer camps, Coach Chris brings his proven training model to Rancho Cucamonga for an unforgettable week of growth and excitement. Hosted at Sofive Rancho Cucamonga, a state-of-the-art soccer facility built for fast-paced play and top-tier instruction, this camp offers the perfect environment for players to sharpen their skills and take their game to the next level. Open to boys and girls ages 6ΓÇô16 of all experience levels, the program features a low coach-to-camper ratio, ensuring every athlete receives personalized feedback, quality repetitions, and individual attention. Campers will develop new techniques, strengthen fundamentals, improve decision-making, and build confidence through dynamic drills and competitive play. ΓÇ£At LA Soccer Camps, our goal is simple, we want kids from all backgrounds to have fun, play the game, and continue developing their skills. Each week we focus on one core fundamental each day, like dribbling, turning, passing, receiving, and shooting, so players can really lock in and build confidence. More than anything, we want kids to leave camp smiling, proud of what they learned, and excited to come back the next day.ΓÇ¥ - Chris Bonawandt, Camp Director',6,16,'all','2026-07-27','2026-07-31',315.0,'per_session','$315-$425','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-sofive-rancho-cucamonga',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','c856c138-1170-42a6-aad7-4fe4b415f590','nike-soccer-camp-at-sofive-rancho-cucamonga-july-27-31-2026-mr0w','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-a1e34b39-93e4-5d7a-8f07-d05fd0f6808a','org-018afa1b-dd82-5a09-9636-b2f840a8a785','nike-soccer-camp-at-eckerd-college-july-27-31-2026','Nike Soccer Camp at Eckerd College -  (July 27ΓÇô31, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Join us for an unforgettable week of soccer this summer at the Nike Soccer Camp at Eckerd College, led by CoΓÇæDirectors Luke Sheekey, Head WomenΓÇÖs Soccer Coach, and Joe Illett, Head MenΓÇÖs Soccer Coach at Eckerd College. Both Luke and Joe are highly respected youthΓÇædevelopment coaches with decades of experience and a proven track record of delivering camps that blend modern coaching methodologies with a fun, competitive atmosphere. This camp is designed for players of all ages and skill levels, offering a dynamic mix of technical training, smallΓÇæsided games, positional development, and highΓÇæenergy competitions. The curriculum emphasizes modern, playerΓÇæcentric instruction, helping athletes sharpen fundamental skills, improve decisionΓÇæmaking, and deepen their understanding of the game while enjoying a positive and supportive environment. Campers will also enjoy the outstanding facilities at Eckerd College, including pristine naturalΓÇægrass fields, shaded waterfront areas perfect for breaks and lunch, and covered spaces ideal for smallΓÇæsided games. To help players stay cool and comfortable during the Florida summer, campers will also have access to the Eckerd College pool, providing a refreshing way to beat the heat while keeping the experience fun and safe. Whether your player is just getting started or preparing for higherΓÇælevel play, this camp offers a memorable, actionΓÇæpacked week of development, connection, and growth on the beautiful waterfront campus of Eckerd College. Coach Luke Sheekey and Joe Illet will also be running camps at Admiral Farragut Academy in St. Petersburg! Details can be found HERE',5,14,'all','2026-07-27','2026-07-31',299.0,'per_session','$299-$445','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-eckerd-college',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','97748d51-9e73-4eb7-a1f3-6269e8910d29','nike-soccer-camp-at-eckerd-college-july-27-31-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-b6aed33b-bcb9-53e9-9fcb-2a412abbfe63','org-62b5b8e2-c652-5840-9d56-7323db19c5ba','nike-soccer-camp-at-westmont-college-santa-barbara-overnight-ii-july-26-31-2026-yen0','Nike Soccer Camp at Westmont College - Santa Barbara - Overnight II (July 26ΓÇô31, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Voted the #1 Nike Soccer Camp Director by parents and campers in 2025! (Top-10 in 2023/2024) Designed for coed players ages 9ΓÇô18, this premier overnight Nike Soccer Camp at Westmont College delivers elite training paired with a fully immersive residential experience on CaliforniaΓÇÖs Central Coast. Hosted on WestmontΓÇÖs scenic Santa Barbara campus, campers enjoy highΓÇæquality soccer facilities, comfortable onΓÇæcampus housing, and topΓÇætier amenities that create an environment built for growth both on and off the field. With previous camp sessions selling out year after year, demand for this experience continues to be extremely high. This summer marks an exciting evolution, as two respected Nike Soccer Camp programs on the Central Coast have officially come together to form one enhanced experience at Westmont College. The former Nike Vogelsinger Soccer Academy and The Soccer Academy Camp (previously held at Cate School) are now unified under one vision, creating a stronger, more impactful camp for every player. The camp is led by Ben Maxwell of Player ONE Performance, Northern CaliforniaΓÇÖs premier clubΓÇæneutral training program since 2017 and the #1 Nike Soccer Camp Director in the U.S. (2026). Ben brings proven leadership and continuity from both programs, delivering a playerΓÇæfocused training experience built on elite standards, high energy, and attention to detail. Campers follow a professionally designed curriculum emphasizing technical development, intelligent movement, goalΓÇæscoring, game awareness, and mental preparation, leaving camp more confident, sharper, and ready to compete at the next level. Whether players are looking to elevate their performance, build confidence, or train alongside highly motivated peers, the overnight Nike Soccer Camp at Westmont College offers a summer experience that is both developmentΓÇædriven and truly memorable.',9,18,'all','2026-07-26','2026-07-31',959.0,'per_session','$959-$1159','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-westmont-college-santa-barbara',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','7cf2d849-084a-40da-b441-bc0bf963edb1','nike-soccer-camp-at-westmont-college-santa-barbara-overnight-ii-july-26-31-2026-yen0','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-e6f9b588-887c-56cb-b082-5695b7aaaa6b','org-532ae02d-7e33-5a35-bc46-fd334c565fb9','nike-soccer-camp-in-evanston-july-27-31-2026-s9zd','Nike Soccer Camp in Evanston -  (July 27ΓÇô31, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Soccer Skill Schools was voted a Top-10 Nike Soccer Camp in 2024 &amp; 2025 by players and parents! Join us for the Nike Soccer Camp in Evanston with Kyle Jones, Director of Soccer Skill Schools. This camp welcomes players of all abilities, ages 6-16, to develop and refine their technical skills in a dynamic, competitive environment. It''s an exceptional opportunity for any player to train under top coaching professionals while having fun and pushing their game to the next level! Soccer Skill Schools'' "Numbers Approach Methodology" brings world-class skill development methods from Brazil, Holland, England, and Spain directly to the Midwest. The Soccer Skill School approach focuses on the individual player by guiding each athlete toward complete mastery of the ball, empowering them to make their own creative decisions, and equipping them with 65+ individual skills to win the one-on-one competitions that determine every game''s outcome. Led by experienced college coaches and current college players, the Soccer Skill Schools staff brings elite-level expertise and mentorship to every session. Training alongside coaches who compete at the collegiate level gives players invaluable insight into what it takes to elevate their game and succeed at the next level! Hear from Coach Kyle Jones: ΓÇ£We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.ΓÇ¥',6,16,'all','2026-07-27','2026-07-31',460.0,'per_session','$460','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-evanston-il',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','f38c1cb8-c2b7-4c5e-832d-1e69c13579ca','nike-soccer-camp-in-evanston-july-27-31-2026-s9zd','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
