rom Coach Kyle Jones: ΓÇ£We create an environment where players are challenged, supported, and inspired every day. Through high-quality coaching and a love for the game, our goal is to help each athlete build confidence, develop their skills, and leave camp better both on and off the field.ΓÇ¥',6,16,'all','2026-07-27','2026-07-31',475.0,'per_session','$475','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-palatine-il',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','5d893e1a-d01e-47b8-88c3-23694d55c3c9','nike-soccer-camp-in-palatine-july-27-31-2026-i3xr','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
