ampers cool, comfortable, and fully engaged. Join us this summer at Sofive - Rockville and train like a PRO!',6,13,'all','2026-07-27','2026-07-31',310.0,'per_session','$310-$440','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-sofive-rockville',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','067d49ec-7c5c-4e31-b1ae-631a8912b799','nike-soccer-camp-with-next-star-at-sofive-rockville-player-development-july-27-3','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
