 stronger foundation, or simply enjoy an unforgettable week of soccer, this Nike Soccer Camp is the perfect opportunity to take your skills to the next level.',6,16,'all','2026-07-27','2026-07-31',265.0,'per_session','$265-$375','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-sofive-elkins-park',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','0c4a45d3-3998-47f7-880e-7a4b9a0241ab','nike-soccer-camp-at-sofive-elkins-park-day-camp-july-27-31-2026-31i6','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-39b4784b-1473-5ab8-9f1a-92712c0d757a','org-7d670432-fb3e-5d79-b54f-cfae10ce7abd','nike-soccer-camp-at-winsor-school-july-27-31-2026-tb1g','Nike Soccer Camp at Winsor School -  (July 27ΓÇô31, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Train this summer at the Nike Soccer Camp on the prestigious Winsor School campus, an inspiring, beautiful setting right in the heart of Boston! This standout location offers the perfect backdrop for players to grow their skills, sharpen their technique, and enjoy an unforgettable week of soccer. Campers will focus on all aspects of the game through dynamic drills, positional training, and exciting scrimmages designed to challenge, motivate, and elevate every young athlete. A Step Ahead (ASA) Nike Soccer Camps are designed for the player looking to improve their game and soccer IQ. Emphasis is placed on fundamental development, shooting, offense/defense, team play, and more. Instruction is available to boys and girls, ages 7-16, playing at all levels, from beginner to advanced. Players are evaluated on the first day and placed in groups based on age and ability. Train hard, make friends, and enjoy an amazing soccer experience at the Nike Soccer Camp at Winsor School ΓÇô Boston!',7,16,'all','2026-07-27','2026-07-31',499.0,'per_session','$499','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-winsor-school',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','af033e64-d6ac-4d3a-a759-2b4cc9a3a644','nike-soccer-camp-a