mbined with top-class coaching, facilities, and athletic training support, each player receives both individual and team instruction designed to accelerate development. This is an incredible opportunity for players from across the country to come together in a unique and inspiring setting, train with top collegiate coaches, and gain a deeper understanding of what it takes to compete at the next level. A perfect camp experience for any player looking to learn what it takes to play at the college level. We look forward to helping you become the best soccer player possible.',13,19,'all','2026-07-30','2026-08-02',539.0,'per_session','$539-$639','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-girls-soccer-college-id-camp-montana-state-university-bozeman',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','201527ba-3e4e-46ce-abff-15af64479fe6','nike-girls-soccer-college-id-camp-in-bozeman-college-id-july-30-aug-2-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
