ch technique and game concepts so the kids build confidence and in turn have a great time. We strongly believe in teamwork and respect and know that through sport these kids are developing important life skills."',6,14,'all','2026-08-03','2026-08-06',335.0,'per_session','$335','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-uw-parkside#session-79298-1212840',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','29dc375c-af99-4beb-8e7d-91a55f67074d','nike-soccer-camp-at-university-of-wisconsin-parkside-aug-3-6-2026-il2v','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
