pete alongside motivated peers, this overnight Nike Soccer Camp at UC Santa Cruz offers a summer experience that is as impactful as it is memorable.',9,18,'all','2026-08-02','2026-08-06',859.0,'per_session','$859-$1059','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-uc-santa-cruz',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','92179a82-c313-494d-8354-49080ced09f4','nike-soccer-camp-with-player-one-performance-uc-santa-cruz-aug-2-6-2026-2lo7','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
