ch technique and game concepts so the kids build confidence and in turn have a great time. We strongly believe in teamwork and respect and know that through sport these kids are developing important life skills."',6,14,'all','2026-08-03','2026-08-06',245.0,'per_session','$245-$335','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-uw-parkside',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','91bd60d9-40c2-4469-9236-697dea2d8f8d','nike-soccer-camp-at-university-of-wisconsin-parkside-aug-3-6-2026-mcbf','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
