e-soccer-camp-with-the-french-football-federation-mercy-college',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','0ba44269-f7ee-4686-a452-1470151d4678','nike-soccer-camp-with-the-french-football-federation-mercy-college-aug-2-6-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
