, offering young players the chance to learn, compete, and grow under experienced, passionate coaches in a positive and engaging environment. Hear from Co-Owner of Prospect Soccer Academy and Camp Director Harry Forrester: "Our camps are delivered by seasoned professional players and coaches who bring real game experience into every session. Built around a proven, development-first philosophy, we prioritize technical excellence through high-repetition training and game-realistic scenarios such as 1v1 and 2v2, helping players build confidence, decision-making, and creativity under pressure. Just as important is the environment we create, structured, supportive, and professionally led, where players are encouraged to take risks, learn from mistakes, and grow. Our goal is for every player to leave not only as a more complete footballer, but with greater confidence, resilience, and a genuine love for the game.ΓÇ¥ Prospect Soccer Academy will be hosting camps in multiple other locations Click here for more info',6,14,'all','2026-08-03','2026-08-07',485.0,'per_session','$485','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-4s-ranch-sports-park-san-diego#session-82294-1217478',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','e4565f63-1547-48e8-9e01-c03f6d910d92','nike-soccer-camp-with-prospect-soccer-academy-4s-ranch-sports-park-aug-3-7-2026-9ghc','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
