l each day, like dribbling, turning, passing, receiving, and shooting, so players can really lock in and build confidence. More than anything, we want kids to leave camp smiling, proud of what they learned, and excited to come back the next day.ΓÇ¥ - Chris Bonawandt, Camp Director',6,16,'all','2026-08-03','2026-08-07',420.0,'per_session','$420','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-sofive-covina#session-82124-1217237',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','905bd98d-ec68-4c9e-8044-8b4b7d67fde6','nike-soccer-camp-at-sofive-covina-aug-3-7-2026-tnv7','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
