scenarios help athletes apply their morning learning in real time. Coaches provide in-game instruction to improve reads, timing, pace, spacing, leadership, and communication.',5,9,'all','2026-08-03','2026-08-07',510.0,'per_session','$510','https://www.ussportscamps.com/basketball/nike/nike-basketball-camp-touch-shooting#session-79841-1213811',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','fba530e7-d53f-4d02-86aa-f5c1fbc3d663','nike-basketball-camp-at-touch-shooting-elite-camp-aug-3-7-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
