nvironment where players are challenged, coached with purpose, and leave each day better than they arrived, both on and off the field." - Nick Woodruff, Camp Director &amp; Founder, Next Step Training',7,14,'all','2026-08-10','2026-08-13',565.0,'per_session','$565','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-ridgefield-academy#session-83236-1218766',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','e894b617-75a7-4a24-9495-4410e547de43','nike-soccer-camp-at-ridgefield-academy-aug-10-13-2026-h8o0','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
