here players are challenged, coached with purpose, and leave each day better than they arrived, both on and off the field." - Nick Woodruff, Camp Director &amp; Founder, Next Step Training',6,16,'all','2026-08-10','2026-08-14',335.0,'per_session','$335-$455','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-brookwood-school',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','1d767ff3-5927-477b-88b1-88b256e430c0','nike-soccer-camp-at-brookwood-school-aug-10-14-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
