to measure, assess, and define unique development programs for every player. Players will begin their week-long experience with a complete Assessment and Baseline Hitting &amp; Pitching analysis before receiving their personalized Camp training program. All players will then engage in 5 days of small group sessions in Hitting, Throwing, Infielding, Outfielding, Baserunning, and Game Situations. Each day will focus on healthy athletic development and skill acquisition in a fun &amp; engaging environment that will also teach the mental/emotional approach needed to eliminate performance anxiety and fear of failure. Players will develop skills that scale, and receive an individualized post-Camp training routine to continue their own development.',8,18,'all','2026-08-24','2026-08-28',1269.0,'per_session','$1269','https://www.ussportscamps.com/baseball/nike/nike-baseball-camp-the-hamptons',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','4112844d-476c-46f9-9c6e-f245440232cb','nike-baseball-camp-in-the-hamptons-aug-24-28-2026-no4k','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-3984ac35-8392-52e9-a609-0fed021565bf','org-a68da485-a4c6-55cf-b0f7-0e430d87da97','nike-soccer-camp-in-moorestown-aug-24-28-2026','Nike Soccer Camp in Moorestown -  (Aug. 24ΓÇô28, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["soccer"]','Join Barry Lynch and his coaching staff at the Nike Soccer Camp in Moorestown. Located at Moorestown High School in Moorestown, NJ, this camp offers the perfect blend of training and gameplay. The focus at camp will be on player development, each camper will refine their technique, learn new skills, compete in games and drills, have fun, and make new friends. This youth soccer camp provides the perfect blend of instruction and fun! Make friends and create memories with our team that will last a lifetime! Sure to be a summer highlight, these camps offer a unique opportunity for aspiring soccer players aged 5-16. Throughout the week campers learn new skills, perfect techniques, increase game knowledge, make new friends and have fun playing soccer!',5,16,'all','2026-08-24','2026-08-28',285.0,'per_session','$285-$395','https://www.ussportscamps.com/soccer/nike/nike-soccer-camp-moorestown-new-jersey',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','9a664023-90ca-476a-bdb0-34b5e6c97a7e','nike-soccer-camp-in-moorestown-aug-24-28-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-c6a38828-ebdf-5837-a240-6812f0709bd7','org-0240edad-be34-5415-bfa4-07141b130c08','nike-adult-tennis-camp-at-weston-racquet-club-adult-beginner-tennis-crash-course','Nike Adult Tennis Camp at Weston Racquet Club - Adult Beginner Tennis Crash Course (Sep. 26ΓÇô27, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["tennis"]','Doubles Tactics &amp; Matchplay Master Course Join us for an action packed tennis clinic weekend focused entirely on doubles strategy and performance. Whether you''re preparing for league play, want to sharpen your court awareness, or just love the dynamic of doubles, this session is for you. Aimed at players between 2.5-4.0 USTA rating. This program is perfect for players who want to improve their doubles instincts, shot selection, and teamworkΓÇöall in a fun, supportive, and challenging environment. Spaces are limited to 16 players, so early sign-up is strongly encouraged! Highlights: Positional drills to master net play, court coverage &amp; communicationTactical instruction for serving strategies, poaching, and returning as a teamLive match play rotations with feedbackServe &amp; volley practice, lob coverage, and middle control drillsGuidance from experienced coach Adam Maddock, bringing a wealth of coaching and competitive insight Adult Beginner Tennis Crash Course Looking to finally learn tennis or get back into the game with confidence? Our Adult Beginner Crash Course is the perfect place to start. Over 6 hours of professional instruction across two sessions, youΓÇÖll get hands-on experience and structured guidance in a welcoming, social environmentΓÇöno pressure, just progress! Whether your goal is to join weekly clinics, play social matches, or just pick up a fun new skill, this crash course is your perfect launchpad. What You''ll Learn: Proper grip and stroke fundamentals (forehands, backhands, serves &amp; volleys)Court positioning and movement basicsScoring, rules, and match etiquetteHow to rally and play real pointsFun games and drills to build your confidence and consistency What''s Included: Racquets available to borrow (no need to buy one yet!)Drinks and light snacks providedSmall group sizes for individual attentionLed by certified coaches with years of experience',18,22,'all','2026-09-26','2026-09-27',299.0,'per_session','$299','https://www.ussportscamps.com/tennis/nike/nike-adult-tennis-camp-at-weston-racquet-club#session-83767-1219481',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','3f6a3e8e-f52d-4ab5-a76c-68eaec5a1c45','nike-adult-tennis-camp-at-weston-racquet-club-adult-beginner-tennis-crash-course','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
INSERT INTO programs (id,organization_id,slug,name,program_type,activity_category,categories,description,age_min,age_max,skill_level,session_start_date,session_end_date,price,price_type,price_text,registration_url,registration_deadline,availability_status,day_or_overnight,lunch_included,aftercare_available,schedule_text,hero_photo_key,record_source,record_status,confidence_score,source_domain,url_health_status,legacy_camp_id,legacy_slug,created_at,last_verified_at,updated_at) VALUES ('prog-e0bd65db-e680-5f85-a7fa-a89854f33dc7','org-f78e7f9d-ea75-580b-a006-40f3ebcb8d6d','nike-adult-tennis-camp-at-la-quinta-resort-club-oct-9-11-2026','Nike Adult Tennis Camp at La Quinta Resort & Club -  (Oct. 9ΓÇô11, 2026)','camp','camp_sports','["tennis"]','Experience an action-packed 3-day weekend at the desertΓÇÖs most premier tennis destination. Led by Camp Director Martin Parkes and his top-notch coaching staff, this camp delivers high-energy drills, live-ball play, and personalized instruction for players of all levels in a fun and supportive setting. Held at the iconic La Quinta Resort &amp; Club, campers enjoy world-class facilities, breathtaking views, and an unforgettable blend of tennis and relaxation. Exclusive special room rates are available only for Nike Tennis Campers, so you can stay steps from the courts and make the most of your getaway. NEW FOR 2026: Join us during the BNP Paribas Open in Indian Wells! Train in the morning, then watch the worldΓÇÖs best compete just minutes away. With unbeatable resort rates, this is the ultimate tennis weekend in the desert.',18,22,'all','2026-10-09','2026-10-11',1025.0,'per_session','$1025','https://www.ussportscamps.com/tennis/nike/nike-adult-tennis-camp-laquinta-resort#session-82883-1218270',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','c8679d5e-177b-480f-b0e8-e2175087baad','nike-adult-tennis-camp-at-la-quinta-resort-club-oct-9-11-2026','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-1