Öll get hands-on experience and structured guidance in a welcoming, social environmentΓÇöno pressure, just progress! Whether your goal is to join weekly clinics, play social matches, or just pick up a fun new skill, this crash course is your perfect launchpad. What You''ll Learn: Proper grip and stroke fundamentals (forehands, backhands, serves &amp; volleys)Court positioning and movement basicsScoring, rules, and match etiquetteHow to rally and play real pointsFun games and drills to build your confidence and consistency What''s Included: Racquets available to borrow (no need to buy one yet!)Drinks and light snacks providedSmall group sizes for individual attentionLed by certified coaches with years of experience',18,22,'all','2026-12-05','2026-12-06',299.0,'per_session','$299','https://www.ussportscamps.com/tennis/nike/nike-adult-tennis-camp-at-weston-racquet-club#session-83765-1219479',NULL,'open','day',0,0,NULL,NULL,'scraped','active',60,'ussportscamps.com','live','261a98d3-acbc-4cf6-a79f-6095a64e79f3','nike-adult-tennis-camp-at-weston-racquet-club-doubles-tennis-matchplay-master-co-tjpp','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z','2026-06-14T23:10:30Z');
